# Every trait, action, bonus action, reaction and
# legendary action the stat blocks print, one object
# each. The race that prints them grants them all.

Aboleth ~ Amphibious	KEY:Creature ~ Aboleth ~ Amphibious	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aboleth Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Amphibious	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:The aboleth can breathe air and water.
Aboleth ~ Eldritch Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Aboleth ~ Eldritch Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aboleth Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Eldritch Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:If destroyed, the aboleth gains a new body in 5d10 days, reviving with all its Hit Points in the Far Realm or another location chosen by the GM. Legendary Resistance (3/Day, or 4/Day in Lair). If the aboleth fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.
Aboleth ~ Mucus Cloud	KEY:Creature ~ Aboleth ~ Mucus Cloud	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aboleth Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Mucus Cloud	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:While underwater, the aboleth is surrounded by mucus. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 14, each creature in a 5-foot Emanation originating from the aboleth at the end of the aboleth’s turn. Failure: The target is cursed. Until the curse ends, the target’s skin becomes slimy, the target can breathe air and water, and it can’t regain Hit Points unless it is underwater. While the cursed creature is outside a body of water, the creature takes 6 (1d12) Acid damage at the end of every 10 minutes unless moisture is applied to its skin before those minutes have passed.
Aboleth ~ Probing Telepathy	KEY:Creature ~ Aboleth ~ Probing Telepathy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aboleth Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Probing Telepathy	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:If a creature the aboleth can see communicates telepathically with the aboleth, the aboleth learns the creature’s greatest desires.
Aboleth ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Aboleth ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aboleth Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:The aboleth makes two Tentacle attacks and uses either Consume Memories or Dominate Mind if available.
Aboleth ~ Tentacle	KEY:Creature ~ Aboleth ~ Tentacle	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aboleth Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Tentacle	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 15 ft. Hit: 12 (2d6 + 5) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14) from one of four tentacles.
Aboleth ~ Consume Memories	KEY:Creature ~ Aboleth ~ Consume Memories	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aboleth Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Consume Memories	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:Intelligence Saving Throw: DC 16, one creature within 30 feet that is Charmed or Grappled by the aboleth. Failure: 10 (3d6) Psychic damage. Success: Half damage. Failure or Success: The aboleth gains the target’s memories if the target is a Humanoid and is reduced to 0 Hit Points by this action.
Aboleth ~ Dominate Mind (2/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Aboleth ~ Dominate Mind (2/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aboleth Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Dominate Mind (2/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 16, one creature the aboleth can see within 30 feet. Failure: The target has the Charmed condition until the aboleth dies or is on a different plane of existence from the target. While Charmed, the target acts as an ally to the aboleth and is under its control while within 60 feet of it. In addition, the aboleth and the target can communicate telepathically with each other over any distance. The target repeats the save whenever it takes damage as well as after every 24 hours it spends at least 1 mile away from the aboleth, ending the effect on itself on a success.
Aboleth ~ Lash	KEY:Creature ~ Aboleth ~ Lash	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aboleth Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Lash	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:The aboleth makes one Tentacle attack.
Aboleth ~ Psychic Drain	KEY:Creature ~ Aboleth ~ Psychic Drain	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aboleth Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Psychic Drain	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:If the aboleth has at least one creature Charmed or Grappled, it uses Consume Memories and regains 5 (1d10) Hit Points.
Air Elemental ~ Air Form	KEY:Creature ~ Air Elemental ~ Air Form	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Air Elemental Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Air Form	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:The elemental can enter a creature’s space and stop there. It can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch without expending extra movement to do so.
Air Elemental ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Air Elemental ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Air Elemental Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:The elemental makes two Thunderous Slam attacks.
Air Elemental ~ Thunderous Slam	KEY:Creature ~ Air Elemental ~ Thunderous Slam	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Air Elemental Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Thunderous Slam	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +8, reach 10 ft. Hit: 14 (2d8 + 5) Thunder damage.
Air Elemental ~ Whirlwind (Recharge 4–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Air Elemental ~ Whirlwind (Recharge 4–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Air Elemental Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Whirlwind (Recharge 4–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.258	DESC:Strength Saving Throw: DC 13, one Medium or smaller creature in the elemental’s space. Failure: 24 (4d10 + 2) Thunder damage, and the target is pushed up to 20 feet straight away from the elemental and has the Prone condition. Success: Half damage only.
Animated Armor ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Animated Armor ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Animated Armor Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.259	DESC:The armor makes two Slam attacks.
Animated Armor ~ Slam	KEY:Creature ~ Animated Armor ~ Slam	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Animated Armor Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Slam	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.259	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Bludgeoning damage.
Animated Flying Sword ~ Slash	KEY:Creature ~ Animated Flying Sword ~ Slash	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Animated Flying Sword Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Slash	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.259	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d8 + 2) Slashing damage.
Animated Rug of Smothering ~ Smother	KEY:Creature ~ Animated Rug of Smothering ~ Smother	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Animated Rug of Smothering Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Smother	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.259	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (2d6 + 3) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, the rug can give it the Grappled condition (escape DC 13) instead of dealing damage. Until the grapple ends, the target has the Blinded and Restrained conditions, is suffocating, and takes 10 (2d6 + 3) Bludgeoning damage at the start of each of its turns. The rug can smother only one creature at a time. While grappling the target, the rug can’t take this action, the rug halves the damage it takes (round down), and the target takes the same amount of damage.
Ankheg ~ Tunneler	KEY:Creature ~ Ankheg ~ Tunneler	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ankheg Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Tunneler	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.259	DESC:The ankheg can burrow through solid rock at half its Burrow Speed and leaves a 10-foot-diameter tunnel in its wake.
Ankheg ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Ankheg ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ankheg Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.259	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5 (with Advantage if the target is Grappled by the ankheg), reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (2d6 + 3) Slashing damage plus 3 (1d6) Acid damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 13).
Ankheg ~ Acid Spray (Recharge 6)	KEY:Creature ~ Ankheg ~ Acid Spray (Recharge 6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ankheg Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Acid Spray (Recharge 6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.259	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 12, each creature in a 30-foot-long, 5-foot-wide Line. Failure: 14 (4d6) Acid damage. Success: Half damage.
Assassin ~ Evasion	KEY:Creature ~ Assassin ~ Evasion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Assassin Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Evasion	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.260	DESC:If the assassin is subjected to an effect that allows it to make a Dexterity saving throw to take only half damage, the assassin instead takes no damage if it succeeds on the save and only half damage if it fails. It can’t use this trait if it has the Incapacitated condition.
Assassin ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Assassin ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Assassin Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.260	DESC:The assassin makes three attacks, using Shortsword or Light Crossbow in any combination.
Assassin ~ Shortsword	KEY:Creature ~ Assassin ~ Shortsword	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Assassin Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Shortsword	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.260	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d6 + 4) Piercing damage plus 17 (5d6) Poison damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the start of the assassin’s next turn.
Assassin ~ Light Crossbow	KEY:Creature ~ Assassin ~ Light Crossbow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Assassin Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Light Crossbow	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.260	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +7, range 80/320 ft. Hit: 8 (1d8 + 4) Piercing damage plus 21 (6d6) Poison damage.
Assassin ~ Cunning Action	KEY:Creature ~ Assassin ~ Cunning Action	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Assassin Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Cunning Action	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.260	DESC:The assassin takes the Dash, Disengage, or Hide action.
Awakened Shrub ~ Rake	KEY:Creature ~ Awakened Shrub ~ Rake	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Awakened Shrub Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rake	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.260	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +1, reach 5 ft. Hit: 1 Slashing damage.
Awakened Tree ~ Slam	KEY:Creature ~ Awakened Tree ~ Slam	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Awakened Tree Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Slam	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.260	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 10 ft. Hit: 14 (3d6 + 4) Bludgeoning damage.
Axe Beak ~ Beak	KEY:Creature ~ Axe Beak ~ Beak	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Axe Beak Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Beak	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.260	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d8 + 2) Slashing damage.
Azer Sentinel ~ Fire Aura	KEY:Creature ~ Azer Sentinel ~ Fire Aura	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Azer Sentinel Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fire Aura	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:At the end of each of the azer’s turns, each creature of the azer’s choice in a 5-foot Emanation originating from the azer takes 5 (1d10) Fire damage unless the azer has the Incapacitated condition.
Azer Sentinel ~ Illumination	KEY:Creature ~ Azer Sentinel ~ Illumination	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Azer Sentinel Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Illumination	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:The azer sheds Bright Light in a 10-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 10 feet.
Azer Sentinel ~ Burning Hammer	KEY:Creature ~ Azer Sentinel ~ Burning Hammer	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Azer Sentinel Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Burning Hammer	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 8 (1d10 + 3) Bludgeoning damage plus 3 (1d6) Fire damage.
Balor ~ Death Throes	KEY:Creature ~ Balor ~ Death Throes	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Balor Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Death Throes	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:The balor explodes when it dies. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 20, each creature in a 30-foot Emanation originating from the balor. Failure: 31 (9d6) Fire damage plus 31 (9d6) Force damage. Success: Half damage. Failure or Success: If the balor dies outside the Abyss, it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Abyss.
Balor ~ Fire Aura	KEY:Creature ~ Balor ~ Fire Aura	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Balor Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fire Aura	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:At the end of each of the balor’s turns, each creature in a 5-foot Emanation originating from the balor takes 13 (3d8) Fire damage.
Balor ~ Legendary Resistance (3/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Balor ~ Legendary Resistance (3/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Balor Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Legendary Resistance (3/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:If the balor fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.
Balor ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Balor ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Balor Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:The balor has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Balor ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Balor ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Balor Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:The balor makes one Flame Whip attack and one Lightning Blade attack.
Balor ~ Flame Whip	KEY:Creature ~ Balor ~ Flame Whip	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Balor Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Flame Whip	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +14, reach 30 ft. Hit: 18 (3d6 + 8) Force damage plus 17 (5d6) Fire damage. If the target is a Huge or smaller creature, the balor pulls the target up to 25 feet straight toward itself, and the target has the Prone condition.
Balor ~ Lightning Blade	KEY:Creature ~ Balor ~ Lightning Blade	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Balor Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Lightning Blade	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +14, reach 10 ft. Hit: 21 (3d8 + 8) Force damage plus 22 (4d10) Lightning damage, and the target can’t take Reactions until the start of the balor’s next turn.
Balor ~ Teleport	KEY:Creature ~ Balor ~ Teleport	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Balor Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Teleport	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:The balor teleports itself or a willing demon within 10 feet of itself up to 60 feet to an unoccupied space the balor can see.
Bandit ~ Scimitar	KEY:Creature ~ Bandit ~ Scimitar	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Bandit Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Scimitar	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +3, reach 5 ft. Hit: 4 (1d6 + 1) Slashing damage.
Bandit ~ Light Crossbow	KEY:Creature ~ Bandit ~ Light Crossbow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Bandit Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Light Crossbow	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +3, range 80/320 ft. Hit: 5 (1d8 + 1) Piercing damage.
Bandit Captain ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Bandit Captain ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Bandit Captain Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:The bandit makes two attacks, using Scimitar and Pistol in any combination.
Bandit Captain ~ Scimitar	KEY:Creature ~ Bandit Captain ~ Scimitar	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Bandit Captain Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Scimitar	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d6 + 3) Slashing damage.
Bandit Captain ~ Pistol	KEY:Creature ~ Bandit Captain ~ Pistol	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Bandit Captain Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pistol	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +5, range 30/90 ft. Hit: 8 (1d10 + 3) Piercing damage.
Bandit Captain ~ Parry	KEY:Creature ~ Bandit Captain ~ Parry	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Bandit Captain Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Parry	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.261	DESC:Trigger: The bandit is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. Response: The bandit adds 2 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss.
Barbed Devil ~ Barbed Hide	KEY:Creature ~ Barbed Devil ~ Barbed Hide	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Barbed Devil Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Barbed Hide	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.262	DESC:At the start of each of its turns, the devil deals 5 (1d10) Piercing damage to any creature it is grappling or any creature grappling it.
Barbed Devil ~ Diabolical Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Barbed Devil ~ Diabolical Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Barbed Devil Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Diabolical Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.262	DESC:If the devil dies outside the Nine Hells, its body disappears in sulfurous smoke, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Nine Hells.
Barbed Devil ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Barbed Devil ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Barbed Devil Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.262	DESC:The devil has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Barbed Devil ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Barbed Devil ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Barbed Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.262	DESC:The devil makes one Claws attack and one Tail attack, or it makes two Hurl Flame attacks.
Barbed Devil ~ Claws	KEY:Creature ~ Barbed Devil ~ Claws	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Barbed Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claws	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.262	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (2d6 + 3) Piercing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 13) from both claws.
Barbed Devil ~ Tail	KEY:Creature ~ Barbed Devil ~ Tail	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Barbed Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Tail	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.262	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 10 ft. Hit: 14 (2d10 + 3) Slashing damage.
Barbed Devil ~ Hurl Flame	KEY:Creature ~ Barbed Devil ~ Hurl Flame	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Barbed Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Hurl Flame	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.262	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +5, range 150 ft. Hit: 17 (5d6) Fire damage. If the target is a flammable object that isn’t being worn or carried, it starts burning.
Basilisk ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Basilisk ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Basilisk Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.262	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (2d6 + 3) Piercing damage plus 7 (2d6) Poison damage.
Basilisk ~ Petrifying Gaze (Recharge 4–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Basilisk ~ Petrifying Gaze (Recharge 4–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Basilisk Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Petrifying Gaze (Recharge 4–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.262	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 12, each creature in a 30-foot Cone. If the basilisk sees its reflection in the Cone, the basilisk must make this save. First Failure: The target has the Restrained condition and repeats the save at the end of its next turn if it is still Restrained, ending the effect on itself on a success. Second Failure: The target has the Petrified condition instead of the Restrained condition.
Bearded Devil ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Bearded Devil ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Bearded Devil Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.262	DESC:The devil has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Bearded Devil ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Bearded Devil ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Bearded Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.262	DESC:The devil makes one Beard attack and one Infernal Glaive attack.
Bearded Devil ~ Beard	KEY:Creature ~ Bearded Devil ~ Beard	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Bearded Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Beard	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.262	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Piercing damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the start of the devil’s next turn. Until this poison ends, the target can’t regain Hit Points.
Bearded Devil ~ Infernal Glaive	KEY:Creature ~ Bearded Devil ~ Infernal Glaive	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Bearded Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Infernal Glaive	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.262	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 10 ft. Hit: 8 (1d10 + 3) Slashing damage. If the target is a creature and doesn’t already have an infernal wound, it is subjected to the following effect. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 12. Failure: The target receives an infernal wound. While wounded, the target loses 5 (1d10) Hit Points at the start of each of its turns. The wound closes after 1 minute, after a spell restores Hit Points to the target, or after the target or a creature within 5 feet of it takes an action to stanch the wound, doing so by succeeding on a DC 12 Wisdom (Medicine) check.
Behir ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Behir ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Behir Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.263	DESC:The behir makes one Bite attack and uses Constrict.
Behir ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Behir ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Behir Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.263	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 10 ft. Hit: 19 (2d12 + 6) Piercing damage plus 11 (2d10) Lightning damage.
Behir ~ Constrict	KEY:Creature ~ Behir ~ Constrict	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Behir Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Constrict	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.263	DESC:Strength Saving Throw: DC 18, one Large or smaller creature the behir can see within 5 feet. Failure: 28 (5d8 + 6) Bludgeoning damage. The target has the Grappled condition (escape DC 16), and it has the Restrained condition until the grapple ends.
Behir ~ Lightning Breath (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Behir ~ Lightning Breath (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Behir Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Lightning Breath (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.263	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 16, each creature in a 90-foot-long, 5-foot-wide Line. Failure: 66 (12d10) Lightning damage. Success: Half damage.
Behir ~ Swallow	KEY:Creature ~ Behir ~ Swallow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Behir Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Swallow	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.263	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 18, one Large or smaller creature Grappled by the behir (the behir can have only one creature swallowed at a time). Failure: The behir swallows the target, which is no longer Grappled. While swallowed, a creature has the Blinded and Restrained conditions, has Total Cover against attacks and other effects outside the behir, and takes 21 (6d6) Acid damage at the start of each of the behir’s turns. If the behir takes 30 damage or more on a single turn from the swallowed creature, the behir must succeed on a DC 14 Constitution saving throw at the end of that turn or regurgitate the creature, which falls in a space within 10 feet of the behir and has the Prone condition. If the behir dies, a swallowed creature is no longer Restrained and can escape from the corpse by using 15 feet of movement, exiting Prone.
Berserker ~ Bloodied Frenzy	KEY:Creature ~ Berserker ~ Bloodied Frenzy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Berserker Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bloodied Frenzy	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.263	DESC:While Bloodied, the berserker has Advantage on attack rolls and saving throws.
Berserker ~ Greataxe	KEY:Creature ~ Berserker ~ Greataxe	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Berserker Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Greataxe	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.263	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 9 (1d12 + 3) Slashing damage.
