Adult Black Dragon ~ Cloud of Insects	KEY:Creature ~ Adult Black Dragon ~ Cloud of Insects	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Adult Black Dragon Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Cloud of Insects	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.264	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 17, one creature the dragon can see within 120 feet. Failure: 22 (4d10) Poison damage, and the target has Disadvantage on saving throws to maintain Concentration until the end of its next turn. Failure or Success: The dragon can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
