Bulette ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Bulette ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Bulette Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.272	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 17 (2d12 + 4) Piercing damage.
Bulette ~ Deadly Leap	KEY:Creature ~ Bulette ~ Deadly Leap	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Bulette Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Deadly Leap	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.272	DESC:The bulette spends 5 feet of movement to jump to a space within 15 feet that contains one or more Large or smaller creatures. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 15, each creature in the bulette’s destination space. Failure: 19 (3d12) Bludgeoning damage, and the target has the Prone condition. Success: Half damage, and the target is pushed 5 feet straight away from the bulette.
Bulette ~ Leap	KEY:Creature ~ Bulette ~ Leap	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Bulette Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Leap	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.272	DESC:The bulette jumps up to 30 feet by spending 10 feet of movement.
