Centaur Trooper ~ Pike	KEY:Creature ~ Centaur Trooper ~ Pike	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Centaur Trooper Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pike	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.272	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 10 ft. Hit: 9 (1d10 + 4) Piercing damage.
Centaur Trooper ~ Longbow	KEY:Creature ~ Centaur Trooper ~ Longbow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Centaur Trooper Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Longbow	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.272	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +4, range 150/600 ft. Hit: 6 (1d8 + 2) Piercing damage.
Centaur Trooper ~ Trampling Charge (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Centaur Trooper ~ Trampling Charge (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Centaur Trooper Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Trampling Charge (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.272	DESC:The centaur moves up to its Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks and can move through the spaces of Medium or smaller creatures. Each creature whose space the centaur enters is targeted once by the following effect. Strength Saving Throw: DC 14. Failure: 7 (1d6 + 4) Bludgeoning damage, and the target has the Prone condition.
Chain Devil ~ Diabolical Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Chain Devil ~ Diabolical Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chain Devil Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Diabolical Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.272	DESC:If the devil dies outside the Nine Hells, its body disappears in sulfurous smoke, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Nine Hells.
Chain Devil ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Chain Devil ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chain Devil Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.272	DESC:The devil has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Chain Devil ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Chain Devil ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chain Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.272	DESC:The devil makes two Chain attacks and uses Conjure Infernal Chain.
Chain Devil ~ Chain	KEY:Creature ~ Chain Devil ~ Chain	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chain Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Chain	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.272	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 10 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Slashing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14) from one of two chains, and it has the Restrained condition until the grapple ends.
Chain Devil ~ Conjure Infernal Chain	KEY:Creature ~ Chain Devil ~ Conjure Infernal Chain	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chain Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Conjure Infernal Chain	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.272	DESC:The devil conjures a fiery chain to bind a creature. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 15, one creature the devil can see within 60 feet. Failure: 9 (2d4 + 4) Fire damage, and the target has the Restrained condition until the end of the devil’s next turn, at which point the chain disappears. If the target is Large or smaller, the devil moves the target up to 30 feet straight toward itself. Success: The chain disappears.
Chain Devil ~ Unnerving Gaze	KEY:Creature ~ Chain Devil ~ Unnerving Gaze	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chain Devil Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Unnerving Gaze	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.272	DESC:Trigger: A creature the devil can see starts its turn within 30 feet of the devil and can see the devil. Response—Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 15, the triggering creature. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition until the end of its turn. Success: The target is immune to this devil’s Unnerving Gaze for 24 hours.
Chimera ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Chimera ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chimera Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.273	DESC:The chimera makes one Ram attack, one Bite attack, and one Claw attack. It can replace the Claw attack with a use of Fire Breath if available.
Chimera ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Chimera ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chimera Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.273	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Piercing damage, or 18 (4d6 + 4) Piercing damage if the chimera had Advantage on the attack roll.
Chimera ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Chimera ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chimera Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.273	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d6 + 4) Slashing damage.
Chimera ~ Ram	KEY:Creature ~ Chimera ~ Ram	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chimera Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Ram	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.273	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (1d12 + 4) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the Prone condition.
Chimera ~ Fire Breath (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Chimera ~ Fire Breath (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chimera Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fire Breath (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.273	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 15, each creature in a 15-foot Cone. Failure: 31 (7d8) Fire damage. Success: Half damage.
Chuul ~ Amphibious	KEY:Creature ~ Chuul ~ Amphibious	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chuul Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Amphibious	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.273	DESC:The chuul can breathe air and water.
Chuul ~ Sense Magic	KEY:Creature ~ Chuul ~ Sense Magic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chuul Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Sense Magic	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.273	DESC:The chuul senses magic within 120 feet of itself. This trait otherwise works like the Detect Magic spell but isn’t itself magical.
Chuul ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Chuul ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chuul Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.273	DESC:The chuul makes two Pincer attacks and uses Paralyzing Tentacles.
Chuul ~ Pincer	KEY:Creature ~ Chuul ~ Pincer	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chuul Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pincer	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.273	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 10 ft. Hit: 9 (1d10 + 4) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14) from one of two pincers.
Chuul ~ Paralyzing Tentacles	KEY:Creature ~ Chuul ~ Paralyzing Tentacles	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Chuul Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Paralyzing Tentacles	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.273	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 13, one creature Grappled by the chuul. Failure: The target has the Poisoned condition and repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically. While Poisoned, the target has the Paralyzed condition.
Clay Golem ~ Acid Absorption	KEY:Creature ~ Clay Golem ~ Acid Absorption	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Clay Golem Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Acid Absorption	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.274	DESC:Whenever the golem is subjected to Acid damage, it takes no damage and instead regains a number of Hit Points equal to the Acid damage dealt.
Clay Golem ~ Berserk	KEY:Creature ~ Clay Golem ~ Berserk	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Clay Golem Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Berserk	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.274	DESC:Whenever the golem starts its turn Bloodied, roll 1d6. On a 6, the golem goes berserk. On each of its turns while berserk, the golem attacks the nearest creature it can see. If no creature is near enough to move to and attack, the golem attacks an object. Once the golem goes berserk, it continues to be berserk until it is destroyed or it is no longer Bloodied.
Clay Golem ~ Immutable Form	KEY:Creature ~ Clay Golem ~ Immutable Form	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Clay Golem Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Immutable Form	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.274	DESC:The golem can’t shape-shift.
Clay Golem ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Clay Golem ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Clay Golem Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.274	DESC:The golem has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Clay Golem ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Clay Golem ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Clay Golem Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.274	DESC:The golem makes two Slam attacks, or it makes three Slam attacks if it used Hasten this turn.
Clay Golem ~ Slam	KEY:Creature ~ Clay Golem ~ Slam	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Clay Golem Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Slam	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.274	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (1d10 + 5) Bludgeoning damage plus 6 (1d12) Acid damage, and the target’s Hit Point maximum decreases by an amount equal to the Acid damage taken.
Clay Golem ~ Hasten (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Clay Golem ~ Hasten (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Clay Golem Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Hasten (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.274	DESC:The golem takes the Dash and Disengage actions.
Cloaker ~ Light Sensitivity	KEY:Creature ~ Cloaker ~ Light Sensitivity	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cloaker Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Light Sensitivity	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.274	DESC:While in Bright Light, the cloaker has Disadvantage on attack rolls.
Cloaker ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Cloaker ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cloaker Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.274	DESC:The cloaker makes one Attach attack and two Tail attacks.
Cloaker ~ Attach	KEY:Creature ~ Cloaker ~ Attach	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cloaker Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Attach	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.274	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (3d6 + 3) Piercing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, the cloaker attaches to it. While the cloaker is attached, the target has the Blinded condition, and the cloaker can’t make Attach attacks against other targets. In addition, the cloaker halves the damage it takes (round down), and the target takes the same amount of damage. The cloaker can detach itself by spending 5 feet of movement. The target or a creature within 5 feet of it can take an action to try to detach the cloaker, doing so by succeeding on a DC 14 Strength (Athletics) check.
Cloaker ~ Tail	KEY:Creature ~ Cloaker ~ Tail	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cloaker Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Tail	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.274	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 10 ft. Hit: 8 (1d10 + 3) Slashing damage.
Cloaker ~ Moan	KEY:Creature ~ Cloaker ~ Moan	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cloaker Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Moan	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.274	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 13, each creature in a 60-foot Emanation originating from the cloaker. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition until the end of the cloaker’s next turn. Success: The target is immune to this cloaker’s Moan for the next 24 hours. Phantasms (Recharge after a Short or Long Rest). The cloaker casts the Mirror Image spell, requiring no spell components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability. The spell ends early if the cloaker starts or ends its turn in Bright Light.
Cloud Giant ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Cloud Giant ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cloud Giant Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.275	DESC:The giant makes two attacks, using Thunderous Mace or Thundercloud in any combination. It can replace one attack with a use of Spellcasting to cast Fog Cloud .
Cloud Giant ~ Thunderous Mace	KEY:Creature ~ Cloud Giant ~ Thunderous Mace	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cloud Giant Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Thunderous Mace	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.275	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +12, reach 10 ft. Hit: 21 (3d8 + 8) Bludgeoning damage plus 7 (2d6) Thunder damage.
Cloud Giant ~ Thundercloud	KEY:Creature ~ Cloud Giant ~ Thundercloud	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cloud Giant Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Thundercloud	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.275	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +12, range 240 ft. Hit: 18 (3d6 + 8) Thunder damage, and the target has the Incapacitated condition until the end of its next turn.
Cloud Giant ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Cloud Giant ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cloud Giant Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.275	DESC:The giant casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 15): At Will: Detect Magic , Fog Cloud , Light 1/Day Each: Control Weather , Gaseous Form , Telekinesis
Cloud Giant ~ Misty Step	KEY:Creature ~ Cloud Giant ~ Misty Step	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cloud Giant Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Misty Step	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.275	DESC:The giant casts the Misty Step spell, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.
Cockatrice ~ Petrifying Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Cockatrice ~ Petrifying Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cockatrice Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Petrifying Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.275	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +3, reach 5 ft. Hit: 3 (1d4 + 1) Piercing damage. If the target is a creature, it is subjected to the following effect. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 11. First Failure: The target has the Restrained condition. The target repeats the save at the end of its next turn if it is still Restrained, ending the effect on itself on a success. Second Failure: The target has the Petrified condition, instead of the Restrained condition, for 24 hours.
Commoner ~ Training	KEY:Creature ~ Commoner ~ Training	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Commoner Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Training	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.275	DESC:The commoner has proficiency in one skill of the GM’s choice and has Advantage whenever it makes an ability check using that skill.
Commoner ~ Club	KEY:Creature ~ Commoner ~ Club	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Commoner Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Club	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.275	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +2, reach 5 ft. Hit: 2 (1d4) Bludgeoning damage.
Copper Dragon Wyrmling ~ Rend	KEY:Creature ~ Copper Dragon Wyrmling ~ Rend	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Copper Dragon Wyrmling Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rend	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.275	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d10 + 2) Slashing damage.
Copper Dragon Wyrmling ~ Acid Breath (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Copper Dragon Wyrmling ~ Acid Breath (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Copper Dragon Wyrmling Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Acid Breath (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.275	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 11, each creature in a 20-foot-long, 5-foot-wide Line. Failure: 18 (4d8) Acid damage. Success: Half damage.
Copper Dragon Wyrmling ~ Slowing Breath	KEY:Creature ~ Copper Dragon Wyrmling ~ Slowing Breath	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Copper Dragon Wyrmling Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Slowing Breath	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.275	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 11, each creature in a 15-foot Cone. Failure: The target can’t take Reactions; its Speed is halved; and it can take either an action or a Bonus Action on its turn, not both. This effect lasts until the end of its next turn.
