Adult Copper Dragon ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Adult Copper Dragon ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Adult Copper Dragon Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.276	DESC:The dragon casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 17): At Will: Detect Magic , Mind Spike (level 4 version), Minor Illusion , Shapechange (Beast or Humanoid form only, no Temporary Hit Points gained from the spell, and no Concentration or Temporary Hit Points required to maintain the spell) 1/Day Each: Greater Restoration , Major Image
Adult Copper Dragon ~ Giggling Magic	KEY:Creature ~ Adult Copper Dragon ~ Giggling Magic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Adult Copper Dragon Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Giggling Magic	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.276	DESC:Charisma Saving Throw: DC 17, one creature the dragon can see within 90 feet. Failure: 24 (7d6) Psychic damage. Until the end of its next turn, the target rolls 1d6 whenever it makes an ability check or attack roll and subtracts the number rolled from the D20 Test. Failure or Success: The dragon can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
Adult Copper Dragon ~ Mind Jolt	KEY:Creature ~ Adult Copper Dragon ~ Mind Jolt	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Adult Copper Dragon Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Mind Jolt	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.276	DESC:The dragon uses Spellcasting to cast Mind Spike (level 4 version). The dragon can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
