Couatl ~ Shielded Mind	KEY:Creature ~ Couatl ~ Shielded Mind	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Couatl Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Shielded Mind	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.277	DESC:The couatl’s thoughts can’t be read by any means, and other creatures can communicate with it telepathically only if it allows them.
Couatl ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Couatl ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Couatl Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.277	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 11 (1d12 + 5) Piercing damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the end of the couatl’s next turn.
