Cultist Fanatic ~ Pact Blade	KEY:Creature ~ Cultist Fanatic ~ Pact Blade	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cultist Fanatic Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pact Blade	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.278	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit : 6 (1d8 + 2) Slashing damage plus 7 (2d6) Necrotic damage.
Cultist Fanatic ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Cultist Fanatic ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cultist Fanatic Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.278	DESC:The cultist casts one of the following spells, using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 12, +4 to hit with spell attacks): At Will: Light , Thaumaturgy 2/Day: Command 1/Day: Hold Person
Cultist Fanatic ~ Spiritual Weapon (2/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Cultist Fanatic ~ Spiritual Weapon (2/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cultist Fanatic Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spiritual Weapon (2/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.278	DESC:The cultist casts the Spiritual Weapon spell, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.
Darkmantle ~ Crush	KEY:Creature ~ Darkmantle ~ Crush	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Darkmantle Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Crush	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.278	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d6 + 3) Bludgeoning damage, and the darkmantle attaches to the target. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature and the darkmantle had Advantage on the attack roll, it covers the target, which has the Blinded condition and is suffocating while the darkmantle is attached in this way. While attached to a target, the darkmantle can attack only the target but has Advantage on its attack rolls. Its Speed becomes 0, it can’t benefit from any bonus to its Speed, and it moves with the target. A creature can take an action to try to detach the darkmantle from itself, doing so with a successful DC 13 Strength (Athletics) check. On its turn, the darkmantle can detach itself by using 5 feet of movement.
Darkmantle ~ Darkness Aura (1/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Darkmantle ~ Darkness Aura (1/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Darkmantle Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Darkness Aura (1/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.278	DESC:Magical Darkness fills a 15-foot Emanation originating from the darkmantle. This effect lasts while the darkmantle maintains Concentration on it, up to 10 minutes. Darkvision can’t penetrate this area, and no light can illuminate it.
Death Dog ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Death Dog ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Death Dog Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.279	DESC:The death dog makes two Bite attacks.
Death Dog ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Death Dog ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Death Dog Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.279	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 4 (1d4 + 2) Piercing damage. If the target is a creature, it is subjected to the following effect. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 12. First Failure: The target has the Poisoned condition. While Poisoned, the target’s Hit Point maximum doesn’t return to normal when finishing a Long Rest, and it repeats the save every 24 hours that elapse, ending the effect on itself on a success. Subsequent Failures: The Poisoned target’s Hit Point maximum decreases by 5 (1d10).
Deva ~ Exalted Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Deva ~ Exalted Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Deva Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Exalted Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.279	DESC:If the deva dies outside Mount Celestia, its body disappears, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in Mount Celestia.
Deva ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Deva ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Deva Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.279	DESC:The deva has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Deva ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Deva ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Deva Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.279	DESC:The deva makes two Holy Mace attacks.
Deva ~ Holy Mace	KEY:Creature ~ Deva ~ Holy Mace	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Deva Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Holy Mace	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.279	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +8, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d6 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 18 (4d8) Radiant damage.
Deva ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Deva ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Deva Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.279	DESC:The deva casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 17): At Will: Detect Evil and Good , Shapechange (Beast or Humanoid form only, no Temporary Hit Points gained from the spell, and no Concentration or Temporary Hit Points required to maintain the spell) 1/Day Each: Commune , Raise Dead
Deva ~ Divine Aid (2/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Deva ~ Divine Aid (2/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Deva Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Divine Aid (2/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.279	DESC:The deva casts Cure Wounds , Lesser Restoration , or Remove Curse , using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.
Djinni ~ Elemental Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Djinni ~ Elemental Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Djinni Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Elemental Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.280	DESC:If the djinni dies outside the Elemental Plane of Air, its body dissolves into mist, and it gains a new body in 1d4 days, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere on the Plane of Air.
Djinni ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Djinni ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Djinni Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.280	DESC:The djinni has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Djinni ~ Wishes	KEY:Creature ~ Djinni ~ Wishes	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Djinni Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Wishes	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.280	DESC:The djinni has a 30 percent chance of knowing the Wish spell. If the djinni knows it, the djinni can cast it only on behalf of a non-genie creature who communicates a wish in a way the djinni can understand. If the djinni casts the spell for the creature, the djinni suffers none of the spell’s stress. Once the djinni has cast it three times, the djinni can’t do so again for 365 days.
Djinni ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Djinni ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Djinni Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.280	DESC:The djinni makes three attacks, using Storm Blade or Storm Bolt in any combination.
Djinni ~ Storm Blade	KEY:Creature ~ Djinni ~ Storm Blade	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Djinni Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Storm Blade	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.280	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 5 feet. Hit: 12 (2d6 + 5) Slashing damage plus 7 (2d6) Lightning damage.
Djinni ~ Storm Bolt	KEY:Creature ~ Djinni ~ Storm Bolt	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Djinni Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Storm Bolt	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.280	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +9, range 120 feet. Hit: 13 (3d8) Thunder damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Prone condition.
Djinni ~ Create Whirlwind	KEY:Creature ~ Djinni ~ Create Whirlwind	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Djinni Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Create Whirlwind	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.280	DESC:The djinni conjures a whirlwind at a point it can see within 120 feet. The whirlwind fills a 20-foot-radius, 60-foot-high Cylinder centered on that point. The whirlwind lasts until the djinni’s Concentration on it ends. The djinni can move the whirlwind up to 20 feet at the start of each of its turns. Whenever the whirlwind enters a creature’s space or a creature enters the whirlwind, that creature is subjected to the following effect. Strength Saving Throw: DC 17 (a creature makes this save only once per turn, and the djinni is unaffected). Failure: While in the whirlwind, the target has the Restrained condition and moves with the whirlwind. At the start of each of its turns, the Restrained target takes 21 (6d6) Thunder damage. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the save, ending the effect on itself on a success.
Djinni ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Djinni ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Djinni Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.280	DESC:The djinni casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 17): At Will: Detect Evil and Good , Detect Magic 2/Day Each: Create Food and Water (can create wine instead of water), Tongues , Wind Walk 1/Day Each: Creation , Gaseous Form , Invisibility , Major Image , Plane Shift
Doppelganger ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Doppelganger ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Doppelganger Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.280	DESC:The doppelganger makes two Slam attacks and uses Unsettling Visage if available.
Doppelganger ~ Slam	KEY:Creature ~ Doppelganger ~ Slam	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Doppelganger Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Slam	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.280	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6 (with Advantage during the first round of each combat), reach 5 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Bludgeoning damage.
Doppelganger ~ Read Thoughts	KEY:Creature ~ Doppelganger ~ Read Thoughts	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Doppelganger Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Read Thoughts	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.280	DESC:The doppelganger casts Detect Thoughts , requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 12).
Doppelganger ~ Unsettling Visage (Recharge 6)	KEY:Creature ~ Doppelganger ~ Unsettling Visage (Recharge 6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Doppelganger Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Unsettling Visage (Recharge 6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.280	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 12, each creature in a 15-foot Emanation originating from the doppelganger that can see the doppelganger. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition and repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically.
Doppelganger ~ Shape-Shift	KEY:Creature ~ Doppelganger ~ Shape-Shift	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Doppelganger Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Shape-Shift	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.280	DESC:The doppelganger shape-shifts into a Medium or Small Humanoid, or it returns to its true form. Its game statistics, other than its size, are the same in each form. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed.
Dragon Turtle ~ Amphibious	KEY:Creature ~ Dragon Turtle ~ Amphibious	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dragon Turtle Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Amphibious	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.281	DESC:The dragon can breathe air and water.
Dragon Turtle ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Dragon Turtle ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dragon Turtle Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.281	DESC:The dragon makes three Bite attacks. It can replace one attack with a Tail attack.
Dragon Turtle ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Dragon Turtle ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dragon Turtle Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.281	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +13, reach 15 ft. Hit: 23 (3d10 + 7) Piercing damage plus 7 (2d6) Fire damage. Being underwater doesn’t grant Resistance to this Fire damage.
Dragon Turtle ~ Tail	KEY:Creature ~ Dragon Turtle ~ Tail	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dragon Turtle Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Tail	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.281	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +13, reach 15 ft. Hit: 18 (2d10 + 7) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Huge or smaller creature, it has the Prone condition.
Dragon Turtle ~ Steam Breath (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Dragon Turtle ~ Steam Breath (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dragon Turtle Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Steam Breath (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.281	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 19, each creature in a 60-foot Cone. Failure: 56 (16d6) Fire damage. Success: Half damage. Failure or Success: Being underwater doesn’t grant Resistance to this Fire damage.
Dretch ~ Rend	KEY:Creature ~ Dretch ~ Rend	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dretch Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rend	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.281	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +3, reach 5 ft. Hit: 4 (1d6 + 1) Slashing damage.
Dretch ~ Fetid Cloud (1/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Dretch ~ Fetid Cloud (1/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dretch Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fetid Cloud (1/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.281	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 11, each creature in a 10-foot Emanation originating from the dretch. Failure: The target has the Poisoned condition until the end of its next turn. While Poisoned, the creature can take either an action or a Bonus Action on its turn, not both, and it can’t take Reactions.
Drider ~ Spider Climb	KEY:Creature ~ Drider ~ Spider Climb	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Drider Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spider Climb	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.281	DESC:The drider can climb difficult surfaces, including along ceilings, without needing to make an ability check.
Drider ~ Sunlight Sensitivity	KEY:Creature ~ Drider ~ Sunlight Sensitivity	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Drider Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Sunlight Sensitivity	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.281	DESC:While in sunlight, the drider has Disadvantage on ability checks and attack rolls.
Drider ~ Web Walker	KEY:Creature ~ Drider ~ Web Walker	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Drider Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Web Walker	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.281	DESC:The drider ignores movement restrictions caused by webs, and the drider knows the location of any other creature in contact with the same web.
Drider ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Drider ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Drider Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.281	DESC:The drider makes three attacks, using Foreleg or Poison Burst in any combination.
Drider ~ Foreleg	KEY:Creature ~ Drider ~ Foreleg	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Drider Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Foreleg	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.281	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 10 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Piercing damage.
Drider ~ Poison Burst	KEY:Creature ~ Drider ~ Poison Burst	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Drider Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Poison Burst	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.281	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +6, range 120 ft. Hit: 13 (3d6 + 3) Poison damage.
Druid ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Druid ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Druid Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:The druid makes two attacks, using Vine Staff or Verdant Wisp in any combination.
Druid ~ Vine Staff	KEY:Creature ~ Druid ~ Vine Staff	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Druid Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Vine Staff	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Bludgeoning damage plus 2 (1d4) Poison damage.
Druid ~ Verdant Wisp	KEY:Creature ~ Druid ~ Verdant Wisp	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Druid Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Verdant Wisp	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +5, range 90 ft. Hit: 10 (3d6) Radiant damage.
Druid ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Druid ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Druid Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:The druid casts one of the following spells, using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 13): At Will: Druidcraft , Speak with Animals 2/Day Each: Entangle , Thunderwave 1/Day Each: Animal Messenger , Longstrider , Moonbeam
Dryad ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Dryad ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dryad Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:The dryad has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Dryad ~ Speak with Beasts and Plants	KEY:Creature ~ Dryad ~ Speak with Beasts and Plants	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dryad Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Speak with Beasts and Plants	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:The dryad can communicate with Beasts and Plants as if they shared a language.
Dryad ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Dryad ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dryad Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:The dryad makes one Vine Lash or Thorn Burst attack, and it can use Spellcasting to cast Charm Monster .
Dryad ~ Vine Lash	KEY:Creature ~ Dryad ~ Vine Lash	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dryad Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Vine Lash	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 10 ft. Hit: 8 (1d8 + 4) Slashing damage.
Dryad ~ Thorn Burst	KEY:Creature ~ Dryad ~ Thorn Burst	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dryad Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Thorn Burst	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +6, range 60 ft. Hit: 7 (1d6 + 4) Piercing damage.
Dryad ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Dryad ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dryad Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:The dryad casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 14): At Will: Animal Friendship , Charm Monster (lasts 24 hours; ends early if the dryad casts the spell again), Druidcraft 1/Day Each: Entangle , Pass without Trace
Dryad ~ Tree Stride	KEY:Creature ~ Dryad ~ Tree Stride	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dryad Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Tree Stride	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:If within 5 feet of a Large or bigger tree, the dryad teleports to an unoccupied space within 5 feet of a second Large or bigger tree that is within 60 feet of the previous tree.
Earth Elemental ~ Earth Glide	KEY:Creature ~ Earth Elemental ~ Earth Glide	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Earth Elemental Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Earth Glide	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:The elemental can burrow through nonmagical, unworked earth and stone. While doing so, the elemental doesn’t disturb the material it moves through.
Earth Elemental ~ Siege Monster	KEY:Creature ~ Earth Elemental ~ Siege Monster	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Earth Elemental Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Siege Monster	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:The elemental deals double damage to objects and structures.
Earth Elemental ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Earth Elemental ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Earth Elemental Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:The elemental makes two attacks, using Slam or Rock Launch in any combination.
Earth Elemental ~ Slam	KEY:Creature ~ Earth Elemental ~ Slam	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Earth Elemental Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Slam	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +8, reach 10 ft. Hit: 14 (2d8 + 5) Bludgeoning damage.
Earth Elemental ~ Rock Launch	KEY:Creature ~ Earth Elemental ~ Rock Launch	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Earth Elemental Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rock Launch	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.282	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +8, range 60 ft. Hit: 8 (1d6 + 5) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Prone condition.
Efreeti ~ Elemental Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Efreeti ~ Elemental Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Efreeti Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Elemental Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:If the efreeti dies outside the Elemental Plane of Fire, its body dissolves into ash, and it gains a new body in 1d4 days, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere on the Plane of Fire.
Efreeti ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Efreeti ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Efreeti Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:The efreeti has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Efreeti ~ Wishes	KEY:Creature ~ Efreeti ~ Wishes	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Efreeti Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Wishes	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:The efreeti has a 30 percent chance of knowing the Wish spell. If the efreeti knows it, the efreeti can cast it only on behalf of a non-genie creature who communicates a wish in a way the efreeti can understand. If the efreeti casts the spell for the creature, the efreeti suffers none of the spell’s stress. Once the efreeti has cast it three times, the efreeti can’t do so again for 365 days.
Efreeti ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Efreeti ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Efreeti Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:The efreeti makes three attacks, using Heated Blade or Hurl Flame in any combination.
Efreeti ~ Heated Blade	KEY:Creature ~ Efreeti ~ Heated Blade	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Efreeti Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Heated Blade	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d6 + 6) Slashing damage plus 13 (2d12) Fire damage.
Efreeti ~ Hurl Flame	KEY:Creature ~ Efreeti ~ Hurl Flame	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Efreeti Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Hurl Flame	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +8, range 120 ft. Hit: 24 (7d6) Fire damage.
Efreeti ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Efreeti ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Efreeti Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:The efreeti casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 16): At Will: Detect Magic , Elementalism 1/Day Each: Gaseous Form , Invisibility , Major Image , Plane Shift , Tongues , Wall of Fire (level 7 version)
Erinyes ~ Diabolical Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Erinyes ~ Diabolical Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Erinyes Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Diabolical Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:If the erinyes dies outside the Nine Hells, its body disappears in sulfurous smoke, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Nine Hells.
Erinyes ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Erinyes ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Erinyes Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:The erinyes has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Erinyes ~ Magic Rope	KEY:Creature ~ Erinyes ~ Magic Rope	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Erinyes Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Rope	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:The erinyes has a magic rope. While bearing it, the erinyes can use the Entangling Rope action. The rope has AC 20, HP 90, and Immunity to Poison and Psychic damage. The rope turns to dust if reduced to 0 Hit Points, if it is 5+ feet away from the erinyes for 1 hour or more, or if the erinyes dies. If the rope is damaged or destroyed, the erinyes can fully restore it when finishing a Short or Long Rest.
Erinyes ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Erinyes ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Erinyes Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:The erinyes makes three Withering Sword attacks and can use Entangling Rope.
Erinyes ~ Withering Sword	KEY:Creature ~ Erinyes ~ Withering Sword	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Erinyes Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Withering Sword	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +8, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Slashing damage plus 11 (2d10) Necrotic damage.
Erinyes ~ Entangling Rope (Requires Magic Rope)	KEY:Creature ~ Erinyes ~ Entangling Rope (Requires Magic Rope)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Erinyes Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Entangling Rope (Requires Magic Rope)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:Strength Saving Throw: DC 16, one creature the erinyes can see within 120 feet. Failure: 14 (4d6) Force damage, and the target has the Restrained condition until the rope is destroyed, the erinyes uses a Bonus Action to release the target, or the erinyes uses Entangling Rope again.
Erinyes ~ Parry	KEY:Creature ~ Erinyes ~ Parry	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Erinyes Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Parry	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.283	DESC:Trigger: The erinyes is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. Response: The erinyes adds 4 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss.
Ettercap ~ Spider Climb	KEY:Creature ~ Ettercap ~ Spider Climb	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ettercap Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spider Climb	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:The ettercap can climb difficult surfaces, including along ceilings, without needing to make an ability check.
Ettercap ~ Web Walker	KEY:Creature ~ Ettercap ~ Web Walker	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ettercap Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Web Walker	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:The ettercap ignores movement restrictions caused by webs, and the ettercap knows the location of any other creature in contact with the same web.
Ettercap ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Ettercap ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ettercap Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:The ettercap makes one Bite attack and one Claw attack.
Ettercap ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Ettercap ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ettercap Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Piercing damage plus 2 (1d4) Poison damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the start of the ettercap’s next turn.
Ettercap ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Ettercap ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ettercap Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (2d4 + 2) Slashing damage.
Ettercap ~ Web Strand (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Ettercap ~ Web Strand (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ettercap Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Web Strand (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 12, one Large or smaller creature the ettercap can see within 30 feet. Failure: The target has the Restrained condition until the web is destroyed (AC 10; HP 5; Vulnerability to Fire damage; Immunity to Bludgeoning, Poison, and Psychic damage).
Ettercap ~ Reel	KEY:Creature ~ Ettercap ~ Reel	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ettercap Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Reel	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:The ettercap pulls one creature within 30 feet of itself that is Restrained by its Web Strand up to 25 feet straight toward itself.
Ettin ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Ettin ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ettin Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:The ettin makes one Battleaxe attack and one Morningstar attack.
Ettin ~ Battleaxe	KEY:Creature ~ Ettin ~ Battleaxe	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ettin Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Battleaxe	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 14 (2d8 + 5) Slashing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Prone condition.
Ettin ~ Morningstar	KEY:Creature ~ Ettin ~ Morningstar	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ettin Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Morningstar	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 14 (2d8 + 5) Piercing damage, and the target has Disadvantage on the next attack roll it makes before the end of its next turn.
Fire Elemental ~ Fire Aura	KEY:Creature ~ Fire Elemental ~ Fire Aura	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Fire Elemental Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fire Aura	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:At the end of each of the elemental’s turns, each creature in a 10-foot Emanation originating from the elemental takes 5 (1d10) Fire damage. Creatures and flammable objects in the Emanation start burning.
Fire Elemental ~ Fire Form	KEY:Creature ~ Fire Elemental ~ Fire Form	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Fire Elemental Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fire Form	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:The elemental can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch without expending extra movement to do so, and it can enter a creature’s space and stop there. The first time it enters a creature’s space on a turn, that creature takes 5 (1d10) Fire damage.
Fire Elemental ~ Illumination	KEY:Creature ~ Fire Elemental ~ Illumination	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Fire Elemental Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Illumination	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:The elemental sheds Bright Light in a 30foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 30 feet.
Fire Elemental ~ Water Susceptibility	KEY:Creature ~ Fire Elemental ~ Water Susceptibility	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Fire Elemental Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Water Susceptibility	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:The elemental takes 3 (1d6) Cold damage for every 5 feet the elemental moves in water or for every gallon of water splashed on it.
Fire Elemental ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Fire Elemental ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Fire Elemental Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:The elemental makes two Burn attacks.
Fire Elemental ~ Burn	KEY:Creature ~ Fire Elemental ~ Burn	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Fire Elemental Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Burn	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.284	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (2d6 + 3) Fire damage. If the target is a creature or a flammable object, it starts burning.
Fire Giant ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Fire Giant ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Fire Giant Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:The giant makes two attacks, using Flame Sword or Hammer Throw in any combination.
Fire Giant ~ Flame Sword	KEY:Creature ~ Fire Giant ~ Flame Sword	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Fire Giant Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Flame Sword	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +11, reach 10 ft. Hit: 21 (4d6 + 7) Slashing damage plus 10 (3d6) Fire damage.
Fire Giant ~ Hammer Throw	KEY:Creature ~ Fire Giant ~ Hammer Throw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Fire Giant Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Hammer Throw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +11, range 60/240 ft. Hit: 23 (3d10 + 7) Bludgeoning damage plus 4 (1d8) Fire damage, and the target is pushed up to 15 feet straight away from the giant and has Disadvantage on the next attack roll it makes before the end of its next turn.
Flesh Golem ~ Aversion to Fire	KEY:Creature ~ Flesh Golem ~ Aversion to Fire	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Flesh Golem Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Aversion to Fire	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:If the golem takes Fire damage, it has Disadvantage on attack rolls and ability checks until the end of its next turn.
Flesh Golem ~ Berserk	KEY:Creature ~ Flesh Golem ~ Berserk	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Flesh Golem Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Berserk	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:Whenever the golem starts its turn Bloodied, roll 1d6. On a 6, the golem goes berserk. On each of its turns while berserk, the golem attacks the nearest creature it can see. If no creature is near enough to move to and attack, the golem attacks an object. Once the golem goes berserk, it remains so until it is destroyed or it is no longer Bloodied. The golem’s creator, if within 60 feet of the berserk golem, can try to calm it by taking an action to make a DC 15 Charisma (Persuasion) check; the golem must be able to hear its creator. If this check succeeds, the golem ceases being berserk until the start of its next turn, at which point it resumes rolling for the Berserk trait again if it is still Bloodied.
Flesh Golem ~ Immutable Form	KEY:Creature ~ Flesh Golem ~ Immutable Form	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Flesh Golem Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Immutable Form	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:The golem can’t shape-shift.
Flesh Golem ~ Lightning Absorption	KEY:Creature ~ Flesh Golem ~ Lightning Absorption	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Flesh Golem Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Lightning Absorption	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:Whenever the golem is subjected to Lightning damage, it regains a number of Hit Points equal to the Lightning damage dealt.
Flesh Golem ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Flesh Golem ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Flesh Golem Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:The golem has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Flesh Golem ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Flesh Golem ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Flesh Golem Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:The golem makes two Slam attacks.
Flesh Golem ~ Slam	KEY:Creature ~ Flesh Golem ~ Slam	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Flesh Golem Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Slam	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 4 (1d8) Lightning damage.
Frost Giant ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Frost Giant ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Frost Giant Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:The giant makes two attacks, using Frost Axe or Great Bow in any combination.
Frost Giant ~ Frost Axe	KEY:Creature ~ Frost Giant ~ Frost Axe	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Frost Giant Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Frost Axe	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 10 ft. Hit: 19 (2d12 + 6) Slashing damage plus 9 (2d8) Cold damage.
Frost Giant ~ Great Bow	KEY:Creature ~ Frost Giant ~ Great Bow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Frost Giant Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Great Bow	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +9, range 150/600 ft. Hit: 17 (2d10 + 6) Piercing damage plus 7 (2d6) Cold damage, and the target’s Speed decreases by 10 feet until the end of its next turn.
Frost Giant ~ War Cry (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Frost Giant ~ War Cry (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Frost Giant Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:War Cry (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.285	DESC:The giant or one creature of its choice that can see or hear it gains 16 (2d10 + 5) Temporary Hit Points and has Advantage on attack rolls until the start of the giant’s next turn.
Shrieker Fungus ~ Shriek	KEY:Creature ~ Shrieker Fungus ~ Shriek	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shrieker Fungus Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Shriek	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.286	DESC:Trigger: A creature or a source of Bright Light moves within 30 feet of the shrieker. Response: The shrieker emits a shriek audible within 300 feet of itself for 1 minute or until the shrieker dies.
Violet Fungus ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Violet Fungus ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Violet Fungus Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.286	DESC:The fungus makes two Rotting Touch attacks.
Violet Fungus ~ Rotting Touch	KEY:Creature ~ Violet Fungus ~ Rotting Touch	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Violet Fungus Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rotting Touch	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.286	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +2, reach 10 ft. Hit: 4 (1d8) Necrotic damage.
Gargoyle ~ Flyby	KEY:Creature ~ Gargoyle ~ Flyby	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gargoyle Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Flyby	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.286	DESC:The gargoyle doesn’t provoke an Opportunity Attack when it flies out of an enemy’s reach.
Gargoyle ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Gargoyle ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gargoyle Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.286	DESC:The gargoyle makes two Claw attacks.
Gargoyle ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Gargoyle ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gargoyle Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.286	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (2d4 + 2) Slashing damage.
Gelatinous Cube ~ Ooze Cube	KEY:Creature ~ Gelatinous Cube ~ Ooze Cube	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gelatinous Cube Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Ooze Cube	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.286	DESC:The cube fills its entire space and is transparent. Other creatures can enter that space, but a creature that does so is subjected to the cube’s Engulf and has Disadvantage on the saving throw. Creatures inside the cube have Total Cover, and the cube can hold one Large creature or up to four Medium or Small creatures inside itself at a time. As an action, a creature within 5 feet of the cube can pull a creature or an object out of the cube by succeeding on a DC 12 Strength (Athletics) check, and the puller takes 10 (3d6) Acid damage.
Gelatinous Cube ~ Transparent	KEY:Creature ~ Gelatinous Cube ~ Transparent	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gelatinous Cube Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Transparent	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.286	DESC:Even when the cube is in plain sight, a creature must succeed on a DC 15 Wisdom (Perception) check to notice the cube if the creature hasn’t witnessed the cube move or otherwise act.
Gelatinous Cube ~ Pseudopod	KEY:Creature ~ Gelatinous Cube ~ Pseudopod	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gelatinous Cube Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pseudopod	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.286	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 12 (3d6 + 2) Acid damage.
Gelatinous Cube ~ Engulf	KEY:Creature ~ Gelatinous Cube ~ Engulf	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gelatinous Cube Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Engulf	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.286	DESC:The cube moves up to its Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks. The cube can move through the spaces of Large or smaller creatures if it has room inside itself to contain them (see the Ooze Cube trait). Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 12, each creature whose space the cube enters for the first time during this move. Failure: 10 (3d6) Acid damage, and the target is engulfed. An engulfed target is suffocating, can’t cast spells with a Verbal component, has the Restrained condition, and takes 10 (3d6) Acid damage at the start of each of the cube’s turns. When the cube moves, the engulfed target moves with it. An engulfed target can try to escape by taking an action to make a DC 12 Strength (Athletics) check. On a successful check, the target escapes and enters the nearest unoccupied space. Success: Half damage, and the target moves to an unoccupied space within 5 feet of the cube. If there is no unoccupied space, the target fails the save instead.
Ghast ~ Stench	KEY:Creature ~ Ghast ~ Stench	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ghast Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Stench	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.287	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 10, any creature that starts its turn in a 5-foot Emanation originating from the ghast. Failure: The target has the Poisoned condition until the start of its next turn. Success: The target is immune to this ghast’s Stench for 24 hours.
Ghast ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Ghast ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ghast Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.287	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Piercing damage plus 9 (2d8) Necrotic damage.
Ghast ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Ghast ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ghast Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.287	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (2d6 + 3) Slashing damage. If the target is a non-Undead creature, it is subjected to the following effect. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 10. Failure: The target has the Paralyzed condition until the end of its next turn.
Ghost ~ Ethereal Sight	KEY:Creature ~ Ghost ~ Ethereal Sight	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ghost Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Ethereal Sight	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.287	DESC:The ghost can see 60 feet into the Ethereal Plane when it is on the Material Plane.
Ghost ~ Incorporeal Movement	KEY:Creature ~ Ghost ~ Incorporeal Movement	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ghost Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Incorporeal Movement	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.287	DESC:The ghost can move through other creatures and objects as if they were Difficult Terrain. It takes 5 (1d10) Force damage if it ends its turn inside an object.
Ghost ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Ghost ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ghost Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.287	DESC:The ghost makes two Withering Touch attacks.
Ghost ~ Withering Touch	KEY:Creature ~ Ghost ~ Withering Touch	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ghost Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Withering Touch	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.287	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 19 (3d10 + 3) Necrotic damage.
Ghost ~ Etherealness	KEY:Creature ~ Ghost ~ Etherealness	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ghost Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Etherealness	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.287	DESC:The ghost casts the Etherealness spell, requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability. The ghost is visible on the Material Plane while on the Border Ethereal and vice versa, but it can’t affect or be affected by anything on the other plane.
Ghost ~ Horrific Visage	KEY:Creature ~ Ghost ~ Horrific Visage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ghost Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Horrific Visage	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.287	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 13, each creature in a 60-foot Cone that can see the ghost and isn’t an Undead. Failure: 10 (2d6 + 3) Psychic damage, and the target has the Frightened condition until the start of the ghost’s next turn. Success: The target is immune to this ghost’s Horrific Visage for 24 hours.
Ghost ~ Possession (Recharge 6)	KEY:Creature ~ Ghost ~ Possession (Recharge 6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ghost Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Possession (Recharge 6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.287	DESC:Charisma Saving Throw: DC 13, one Humanoid the ghost can see within 5 feet. Failure: The target is possessed by the ghost; the ghost disappears, and the target has the Incapacitated condition and loses control of its body. The ghost now controls the body, but the target retains awareness. The ghost can’t be targeted by any attack, spell, or other effect, except ones that specifically target Undead. The ghost’s game statistics are the same, except it uses the possessed target’s Speed, as well as the target’s Strength, Dexterity, and Constitution modifiers. The possession lasts until the body drops to 0 Hit Points or the ghost leaves as a Bonus Action. When the possession ends, the ghost appears in an unoccupied space within 5 feet of the target, and the target is immune to this ghost’s Possession for 24 hours. Success: The target is immune to this ghost’s Possession for 24 hours.
Ghoul ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Ghoul ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ghoul Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.288	DESC:The ghoul makes two Bite attacks.
Ghoul ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Ghoul ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ghoul Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.288	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Piercing damage plus 3 (1d6) Necrotic damage.
Ghoul ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Ghoul ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ghoul Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.288	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 4 (1d4 + 2) Slashing damage. If the target is a creature that isn’t an Undead or elf, it is subjected to the following effect. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 10. Failure: The target has the Paralyzed condition until the end of its next turn.
Gibbering Mouther ~ Aberrant Ground	KEY:Creature ~ Gibbering Mouther ~ Aberrant Ground	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gibbering Mouther Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Aberrant Ground	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.288	DESC:The ground in a 10-foot Emanation originating from the mouther is Difficult Terrain.
Gibbering Mouther ~ Gibbering	KEY:Creature ~ Gibbering Mouther ~ Gibbering	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gibbering Mouther Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Gibbering	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.288	DESC:The mouther babbles incoherently while it doesn’t have the Incapacitated condition. Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 10, any creature that starts its turn within 20 feet of the mouther while it is babbling. Failure: The target rolls 1d8 to determine what it does during the current turn: 1–4. The target does nothing. 5–6. The target takes no action or Bonus Action and uses all its movement to move in a random direction. 7–8. The target makes a melee attack against a randomly determined creature within its reach or does nothing if it can’t make such an attack.
Gibbering Mouther ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Gibbering Mouther ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gibbering Mouther Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.288	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +2, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (2d6) Piercing damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the Prone condition. The target dies if it is reduced to 0 Hit Points by this attack. Its body is then absorbed into the mouther, leaving only equipment behind.
Gibbering Mouther ~ Blinding Spittle (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Gibbering Mouther ~ Blinding Spittle (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gibbering Mouther Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Blinding Spittle (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.288	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 10, each creature in a 10-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point within 30 feet. Failure: 7 (2d6) Radiant damage, and the target has the Blinded condition until the end of the mouther’s next turn.
Glabrezu ~ Demonic Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Glabrezu ~ Demonic Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Glabrezu Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Demonic Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.289	DESC:If the glabrezu dies outside the Abyss, its body dissolves into ichor, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Abyss.
Glabrezu ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Glabrezu ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Glabrezu Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.289	DESC:The glabrezu has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Glabrezu ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Glabrezu ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Glabrezu Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.289	DESC:The glabrezu makes two Pincer attacks and uses Pummel or Spellcasting.
Glabrezu ~ Pincer	KEY:Creature ~ Glabrezu ~ Pincer	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Glabrezu Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pincer	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.289	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 10 ft. Hit: 16 (2d10 + 5) Slashing damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 15) from one of two pincers.
