Gray Ooze ~ Amorphous	KEY:Creature ~ Gray Ooze ~ Amorphous	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gray Ooze Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Amorphous	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.293	DESC:The ooze can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch without expending extra movement to do so.
