Homunculus ~ Telepathic Bond	KEY:Creature ~ Homunculus ~ Telepathic Bond	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Homunculus Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Telepathic Bond	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.299	DESC:While the homunculus is on the same plane of existence as its master, the two of them can communicate telepathically with each other.
Homunculus ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Homunculus ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Homunculus Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.299	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 1 Piercing damage, and the target is subjected to the following effect. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 12. Failure: The target has the Poisoned condition until the end of the homunculus’s next turn. Failure by 5 or More: The target has the Poisoned condition for 1 minute. While Poisoned, the target has the Unconscious condition, which ends early if the target takes any damage.
Horned Devil ~ Diabolical Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Horned Devil ~ Diabolical Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Horned Devil Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Diabolical Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.299	DESC:If the devil dies outside the Nine Hells, its body disappears in sulfurous smoke, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Nine Hells.
