Horned Devil ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Horned Devil ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Horned Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.299	DESC:The devil makes three attacks, using Searing Fork or Hurl Flame in any combination. It can replace one attack with a use of Infernal Tail.
Horned Devil ~ Searing Fork	KEY:Creature ~ Horned Devil ~ Searing Fork	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Horned Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Searing Fork	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.299	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 10 ft. Hit: 15 (2d8 + 6) Piercing damage plus 9 (2d8) Fire damage.
Horned Devil ~ Hurl Flame	KEY:Creature ~ Horned Devil ~ Hurl Flame	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Horned Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Hurl Flame	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.299	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +8, range 150 ft. Hit: 26 (5d8 + 4) Fire damage. If the target is a flammable object that isn’t being worn or carried, it starts burning.
Horned Devil ~ Infernal Tail	KEY:Creature ~ Horned Devil ~ Infernal Tail	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Horned Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Infernal Tail	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.299	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 17, one creature the devil can see within 10 feet. Failure: 10 (1d8 + 6) Necrotic damage, and the target receives an infernal wound if it doesn’t have one. While wounded, the target loses 10 (3d6) Hit Points at the start of each of its turns. The wound closes after 1 minute, after a spell restores Hit Points to the target, or after the target or a creature within 5 feet of it takes an action to stanch the wound, doing so by succeeding on a DC 17 Wisdom (Medicine) check.
Hydra ~ Hold Breath	KEY:Creature ~ Hydra ~ Hold Breath	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Hydra Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Hold Breath	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:The hydra can hold its breath for 1 hour.
Hydra ~ Multiple Heads	KEY:Creature ~ Hydra ~ Multiple Heads	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Hydra Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiple Heads	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:The hydra has five heads. Whenever the hydra takes 25 damage or more on a single turn, one of its heads dies. The hydra dies if all its heads are dead. At the end of each of its turns when it has at least one living head, the hydra grows two heads for each of its heads that died since its last turn, unless it has taken Fire damage since its last turn. The hydra regains 20 Hit Points when it grows new heads.
Hydra ~ Reactive Heads	KEY:Creature ~ Hydra ~ Reactive Heads	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Hydra Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Reactive Heads	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:For each head the hydra has beyond one, it gets an extra Reaction that can be used only for Opportunity Attacks.
Hydra ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Hydra ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Hydra Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:The hydra makes as many Bite attacks as it has heads.
Hydra ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Hydra ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Hydra Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +8, reach 10 ft. Hit: 10 (1d10 + 5) Piercing damage.
Ice Devil ~ Diabolical Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Ice Devil ~ Diabolical Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ice Devil Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Diabolical Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:If the devil dies outside the Nine Hells, its body disappears in sulfurous smoke, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Nine Hells.
Ice Devil ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Ice Devil ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ice Devil Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:The devil has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Ice Devil ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Ice Devil ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ice Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:The devil makes three Ice Spear attacks. It can replace one attack with a Tail attack.
Ice Devil ~ Ice Spear	KEY:Creature ~ Ice Devil ~ Ice Spear	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ice Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Ice Spear	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +10, reach 5 ft. or range 30/120 ft. Hit: 14 (2d8 + 5) Piercing damage plus 10 (3d6) Cold damage. Until the end of its next turn, the target can’t take a Bonus Action or Reaction, its Speed decreases by 10 feet, and it can move or take one action on its turn, not both. Hit or Miss: The spear magically returns to the devil’s hand immediately after a ranged attack.
Ice Devil ~ Tail	KEY:Creature ~ Ice Devil ~ Tail	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ice Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Tail	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 10 ft. Hit: 15 (3d6 + 5) Bludgeoning damage plus 18 (4d8) Cold damage.
Ice Devil ~ Ice Wall (Recharge 6)	KEY:Creature ~ Ice Devil ~ Ice Wall (Recharge 6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ice Devil Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Ice Wall (Recharge 6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:The devil casts Wall of Ice (level 8 version), requiring no spell components and using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 17).
Imp ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Imp ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Imp Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:The imp has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Imp ~ Sting	KEY:Creature ~ Imp ~ Sting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Imp Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Sting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d6 + 3) Piercing damage plus 7 (2d6) Poison damage.
Imp ~ Invisibility	KEY:Creature ~ Imp ~ Invisibility	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Imp Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Invisibility	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:The imp casts Invisibility on itself, requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability.
Imp ~ Shape-Shift	KEY:Creature ~ Imp ~ Shape-Shift	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Imp Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Shape-Shift	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.300	DESC:The imp shape-shifts to resemble a rat (Speed 20 ft.), a raven (20 ft., Fly 60 ft.), or a spider (20 ft., Climb 20 ft.), or it returns to its true form. Its game statistics are the same in each form, except for its Speed. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed.
Incubus ~ Succubus Form	KEY:Creature ~ Incubus ~ Succubus Form	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Incubus Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Succubus Form	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.301	DESC:When the incubus finishes a Long Rest, it can shape-shift into a Succubus , using that stat block instead of this one. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed.
Incubus ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Incubus ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Incubus Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.301	DESC:The incubus makes two Restless Touch attacks.
Incubus ~ Restless Touch	KEY:Creature ~ Incubus ~ Restless Touch	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Incubus Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Restless Touch	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.301	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 15 (3d6 + 5) Psychic damage, and the target is cursed for 24 hours or until the incubus dies. Until the curse ends, the target gains no benefit from finishing Short Rests.
Incubus ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Incubus ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Incubus Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.301	DESC:The incubus casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 15): At Will: Disguise Self , Etherealness 1/Day Each: Dream , Hypnotic Pattern
Incubus ~ Nightmare (Recharge 6)	KEY:Creature ~ Incubus ~ Nightmare (Recharge 6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Incubus Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Nightmare (Recharge 6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.301	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 15, one creature the incubus can see within 60 feet. Failure: If the target has 20 Hit Points or fewer, it has the Unconscious condition for 1 hour, until it takes damage, or until a creature within 5 feet of it takes an action to wake it. Otherwise, the target takes 18 (4d8) Psychic damage.
Invisible Stalker ~ Air Form	KEY:Creature ~ Invisible Stalker ~ Air Form	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Invisible Stalker Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Air Form	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.301	DESC:The stalker can enter an enemy’s space and stop there. It can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch without expending extra movement to do so.
Invisible Stalker ~ Invisibility	KEY:Creature ~ Invisible Stalker ~ Invisibility	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Invisible Stalker Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Invisibility	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.301	DESC:The stalker has the Invisible condition.
Invisible Stalker ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Invisible Stalker ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Invisible Stalker Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.301	DESC:The stalker makes three Wind Swipe attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Vortex.
Invisible Stalker ~ Wind Swipe	KEY:Creature ~ Invisible Stalker ~ Wind Swipe	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Invisible Stalker Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Wind Swipe	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.301	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Force damage.
Invisible Stalker ~ Vortex	KEY:Creature ~ Invisible Stalker ~ Vortex	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Invisible Stalker Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Vortex	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.301	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 14, one Large or smaller creature in the stalker’s space. Failure: 7 (1d8 + 3) Thunder damage, and the target has the Grappled condition (escape DC 13). Until the grapple ends, the target can’t cast spells with a Verbal component and takes 7 (2d6) Thunder damage at the start of each of the stalker’s turns.
Iron Golem ~ Fire Absorption	KEY:Creature ~ Iron Golem ~ Fire Absorption	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Iron Golem Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fire Absorption	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:Whenever the golem is subjected to Fire damage, it regains a number of Hit Points equal to the Fire damage dealt.
Iron Golem ~ Immutable Form	KEY:Creature ~ Iron Golem ~ Immutable Form	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Iron Golem Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Immutable Form	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:The golem can’t shape-shift.
Iron Golem ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Iron Golem ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Iron Golem Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:The golem has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Iron Golem ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Iron Golem ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Iron Golem Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:The golem makes two attacks, using Bladed Arm or Fiery Bolt in any combination.
Iron Golem ~ Bladed Arm	KEY:Creature ~ Iron Golem ~ Bladed Arm	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Iron Golem Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bladed Arm	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +12, reach 10 ft. Hit: 20 (3d8 + 7) Slashing damage plus 10 (3d6) Fire damage.
Iron Golem ~ Fiery Bolt	KEY:Creature ~ Iron Golem ~ Fiery Bolt	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Iron Golem Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fiery Bolt	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +10, range 120 ft. Hit: 36 (8d8) Fire damage.
Iron Golem ~ Poison Breath (Recharge 6)	KEY:Creature ~ Iron Golem ~ Poison Breath (Recharge 6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Iron Golem Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Poison Breath (Recharge 6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 18, each creature in a 60-foot Cone. Failure: 55 (10d10) Poison damage. Success: Half damage.
Knight ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Knight ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Knight Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:The knight makes two attacks, using Greatsword or Heavy Crossbow in any combination.
Knight ~ Greatsword	KEY:Creature ~ Knight ~ Greatsword	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Knight Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Greatsword	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (2d6 + 3) Slashing damage plus 4 (1d8) Radiant damage.
Knight ~ Heavy Crossbow	KEY:Creature ~ Knight ~ Heavy Crossbow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Knight Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Heavy Crossbow	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +2, range 100/400 ft. Hit: 11 (2d10) Piercing damage plus 4 (1d8) Radiant damage.
Knight ~ Parry	KEY:Creature ~ Knight ~ Parry	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Knight Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Parry	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:Trigger: The knight is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. Response: The knight adds 2 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss.
Kobold Warrior ~ Pack Tactics	KEY:Creature ~ Kobold Warrior ~ Pack Tactics	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Kobold Warrior Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pack Tactics	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:The kobold has Advantage on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the kobold’s allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally doesn’t have the Incapacitated condition.
Kobold Warrior ~ Sunlight Sensitivity	KEY:Creature ~ Kobold Warrior ~ Sunlight Sensitivity	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Kobold Warrior Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Sunlight Sensitivity	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:While in sunlight, the kobold has Disadvantage on ability checks and attack rolls.
Kobold Warrior ~ Dagger	KEY:Creature ~ Kobold Warrior ~ Dagger	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Kobold Warrior Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Dagger	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.302	DESC:Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft. Hit: 4 (1d4 + 2) Piercing damage.
Kraken ~ Amphibious	KEY:Creature ~ Kraken ~ Amphibious	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Kraken Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Amphibious	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:The kraken can breathe air and water. Legendary Resistance (4/Day, or 5/Day in Lair). If the kraken fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.
Kraken ~ Siege Monster	KEY:Creature ~ Kraken ~ Siege Monster	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Kraken Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Siege Monster	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:The kraken deals double damage to objects and structures.
Kraken ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Kraken ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Kraken Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:The kraken makes two Tentacle attacks and uses Fling, Lightning Strike, or Swallow.
Kraken ~ Tentacle	KEY:Creature ~ Kraken ~ Tentacle	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Kraken Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Tentacle	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +17, reach 30 ft. Hit: 24 (4d6 + 10) Bludgeoning damage. The target has the Grappled condition (escape DC 20) from one of ten tentacles, and it has the Restrained condition until the grapple ends.
Kraken ~ Fling	KEY:Creature ~ Kraken ~ Fling	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Kraken Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fling	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:The kraken throws a Large or smaller creature Grappled by it to a space it can see within 60 feet of itself that isn’t in the air. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 25, the creature thrown and each creature in the destination space. Failure: 18 (4d8) Bludgeoning damage, and the target has the Prone condition. Success: Half damage only.
Kraken ~ Lightning Strike	KEY:Creature ~ Kraken ~ Lightning Strike	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Kraken Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Lightning Strike	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 23, one creature the kraken can see within 120 feet. Failure: 33 (6d10) Lightning damage. Success: Half damage.
Kraken ~ Swallow	KEY:Creature ~ Kraken ~ Swallow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Kraken Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Swallow	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 25, one creature Grappled by the kraken (it can have up to four creatures swallowed at a time). Failure: 23 (3d8 + 10) Piercing damage. If the target is Large or smaller, it is swallowed and no longer Grappled. A swallowed creature has the Restrained condition, has Total Cover against attacks and other effects outside the kraken, and takes 24 (7d6) Acid damage at the start of each of its turns. If the kraken takes 50 damage or more on a single turn from a creature inside it, the kraken must succeed on a DC 25 Constitution saving throw at the end of that turn or regurgitate all swallowed creatures, each of which falls in a space within 10 feet of the kraken with the Prone condition. If the kraken dies, any swallowed creature no longer has the Restrained condition and can escape from the corpse using 15 feet of movement, exiting Prone.
Kraken ~ Storm Bolt	KEY:Creature ~ Kraken ~ Storm Bolt	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Kraken Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Storm Bolt	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:The kraken uses Lightning Strike.
Kraken ~ Toxic Ink	KEY:Creature ~ Kraken ~ Toxic Ink	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Kraken Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Toxic Ink	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 23, each creature in a 15-foot Emanation originating from the kraken while it is underwater. Failure: The target has the Blinded and Poisoned conditions until the end of the kraken’s next turn. The kraken then moves up to its Speed. Failure or Success: The kraken can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
Lamia ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Lamia ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lamia Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:The lamia makes two Claw attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Corrupting Touch.
Lamia ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Lamia ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lamia Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Slashing damage plus 7 (2d6) Psychic damage.
Lamia ~ Corrupting Touch	KEY:Creature ~ Lamia ~ Corrupting Touch	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lamia Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Corrupting Touch	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 13, one creature the lamia can see within 5 feet. Failure: 13 (3d8) Psychic damage, and the target is cursed for 1 hour. Until the curse ends, the target has the Charmed and Poisoned conditions.
Lamia ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Lamia ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lamia Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:The lamia casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 13): At Will: Disguise Self (can appear as a Large or Medium biped), Minor Illusion 1/Day Each: Geas , Major Image , Scrying
Lamia ~ Leap	KEY:Creature ~ Lamia ~ Leap	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lamia Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Leap	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.303	DESC:The lamia jumps up to 30 feet by spending 10 feet of movement.
Lemure ~ Hellish Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Lemure ~ Hellish Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lemure Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Hellish Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.304	DESC:If the lemure dies in the Nine Hells, it revives with all its Hit Points in 1d10 days unless it is killed by a creature under the effects of a Bless spell or its remains are sprinkled with Holy Water.
Lemure ~ Vile Slime	KEY:Creature ~ Lemure ~ Vile Slime	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lemure Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Vile Slime	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.304	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +2, reach 5 ft. Hit: 2 (1d4) Poison damage.
Lich ~ Spirit Jar	KEY:Creature ~ Lich ~ Spirit Jar	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lich Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spirit Jar	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.304	DESC:If destroyed, the lich reforms in 1d10 days if it has a spirit jar, reviving with all its Hit Points. The new body appears in an unoccupied space within the lich’s lair.
Lich ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Lich ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lich Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.304	DESC:The lich makes three attacks, using Eldritch Burst or Paralyzing Touch in any combination.
Lich ~ Eldritch Burst	KEY:Creature ~ Lich ~ Eldritch Burst	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lich Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Eldritch Burst	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.304	DESC:Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +12, reach 5 ft. or range 120 ft. Hit: 31 (4d12 + 5) Force damage.
Lich ~ Paralyzing Touch	KEY:Creature ~ Lich ~ Paralyzing Touch	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lich Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Paralyzing Touch	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.304	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +12, reach 5 ft. Hit: 15 (3d6 + 5) Cold damage, and the target has the Paralyzed condition until the start of the lich’s next turn.
Lich ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Lich ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lich Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.304	DESC:The lich casts one of the following spells, using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 20): At Will: Detect Magic , Detect Thoughts , Dispel Magic , Fireball (level 5 version), Invisibility , Lightning Bolt (level 5 version), Mage Hand , Prestidigitation 2/Day Each: Animate Dead , Dimension Door , Plane Shift 1/Day Each: Chain Lightning , Finger of Death , Power Word Kill , Scrying
Lich ~ Protective Magic	KEY:Creature ~ Lich ~ Protective Magic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lich Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Protective Magic	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.304	DESC:The lich casts Counterspell or Shield in response to the spell’s trigger, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.
Lich ~ Deathly Teleport	KEY:Creature ~ Lich ~ Deathly Teleport	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lich Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Deathly Teleport	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.304	DESC:The lich teleports up to 60 feet to an unoccupied space it can see, and each creature within 10 feet of the space it left takes 11 (2d10) Necrotic damage.
Lich ~ Disrupt Life	KEY:Creature ~ Lich ~ Disrupt Life	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lich Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Disrupt Life	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.304	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 20, each creature that isn’t an Undead in a 20-foot Emanation originating from the lich. Failure: 31 (9d6) Necrotic damage. Success: Half damage. Failure or Success: The lich can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
Lich ~ Frightening Gaze	KEY:Creature ~ Lich ~ Frightening Gaze	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Lich Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Frightening Gaze	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.304	DESC:The lich casts Fear , using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting. The lich can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
Mage ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Mage ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mage Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.305	DESC:The mage makes three Arcane Burst attacks.
