Magmin ~ Touch	KEY:Creature ~ Magmin ~ Touch	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Magmin Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Touch	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.305	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (2d4 + 2) Fire damage. If the target is a creature or a flammable object that isn’t being worn or carried, it starts burning.
