Manticore ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Manticore ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Manticore Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:The manticore makes three attacks, using Rend or Tail Spike in any combination.
Manticore ~ Rend	KEY:Creature ~ Manticore ~ Rend	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Manticore Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rend	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Slashing damage.
Manticore ~ Tail Spike	KEY:Creature ~ Manticore ~ Tail Spike	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Manticore Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Tail Spike	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +5, range 100/200 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Piercing damage.
Marilith ~ Demonic Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Marilith ~ Demonic Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Marilith Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Demonic Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:If the marilith dies outside the Abyss, its body dissolves into ichor, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Abyss.
Marilith ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Marilith ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Marilith Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:The marilith has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Marilith ~ Reactive	KEY:Creature ~ Marilith ~ Reactive	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Marilith Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Reactive	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:The marilith can take one Reaction on every turn of combat.
Marilith ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Marilith ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Marilith Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:The marilith makes six Pact Blade attacks and uses Constrict.
Marilith ~ Pact Blade	KEY:Creature ~ Marilith ~ Pact Blade	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Marilith Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pact Blade	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (1d10 + 5) Slashing damage plus 7 (2d6) Necrotic damage.
Marilith ~ Constrict	KEY:Creature ~ Marilith ~ Constrict	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Marilith Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Constrict	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:Strength Saving Throw: DC 17, one Medium or smaller creature the marilith can see within 5 feet. Failure: 15 (2d10 + 4) Bludgeoning damage. The target has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14), and it has the Restrained condition until the grapple ends.
Marilith ~ Teleport (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Marilith ~ Teleport (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Marilith Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Teleport (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:The marilith teleports up to 120 feet to an unoccupied space it can see.
Marilith ~ Parry	KEY:Creature ~ Marilith ~ Parry	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Marilith Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Parry	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:Trigger: The marilith is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. Response: The marilith adds 5 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss.
Medusa ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Medusa ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Medusa Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:The medusa makes two Claw attacks and one Snake Hair attack, or it makes three Poison Ray attacks.
Medusa ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Medusa ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Medusa Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (2d6 + 3) Slashing damage.
Medusa ~ Snake Hair	KEY:Creature ~ Medusa ~ Snake Hair	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Medusa Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Snake Hair	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d4 + 3) Piercing damage plus 14 (4d6) Poison damage.
Medusa ~ Poison Ray	KEY:Creature ~ Medusa ~ Poison Ray	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Medusa Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Poison Ray	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +5, range 150 ft. Hit: 11 (2d8 + 2) Poison damage.
Medusa ~ Petrifying Gaze (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Medusa ~ Petrifying Gaze (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Medusa Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Petrifying Gaze (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.306	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 13, each creature in a 30-foot Cone. If the medusa sees its reflection in the Cone, the medusa must make this save. First Failure: The target has the Restrained condition and repeats the save at the end of its next turn if it is still Restrained, ending the effect on itself on a success. Second Failure: The target has the Petrified condition instead of the Restrained condition.
Dust Mephit ~ Death Burst	KEY:Creature ~ Dust Mephit ~ Death Burst	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dust Mephit Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Death Burst	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.307	DESC:The mephit explodes when it dies. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 10, each creature in a 5-foot Emanation originating from the mephit. Failure: 5 (2d4) Bludgeoning damage. Success: Half damage.
Dust Mephit ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Dust Mephit ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dust Mephit Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.307	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 4 (1d4 + 2) Slashing damage.
Dust Mephit ~ Blinding Breath (Recharge 6)	KEY:Creature ~ Dust Mephit ~ Blinding Breath (Recharge 6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dust Mephit Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Blinding Breath (Recharge 6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.307	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 10, each creature in a 15-foot Cone. Failure: The target has the Blinded condition until the end of the mephit’s next turn.
