Magma Mephit ~ Fire Breath (Recharge 6)	KEY:Creature ~ Magma Mephit ~ Fire Breath (Recharge 6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Magma Mephit Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fire Breath (Recharge 6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.307	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 11, each creature in a 15-foot Cone. Failure: 7 (2d6) Fire damage. Success: Half damage.
Steam Mephit ~ Blurred Form	KEY:Creature ~ Steam Mephit ~ Blurred Form	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Steam Mephit Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Blurred Form	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:Attack rolls against the mephit are made with Disadvantage unless the mephit has the Incapacitated condition.
