Steam Mephit ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Steam Mephit ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Steam Mephit Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +2, reach 5 ft. Hit: 2 (1d4) Slashing damage plus 2 (1d4) Fire damage.
Steam Mephit ~ Steam Breath (Recharge 6)	KEY:Creature ~ Steam Mephit ~ Steam Breath (Recharge 6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Steam Mephit Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Steam Breath (Recharge 6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 10, each creature in a 15-foot Cone. Failure: 5 (2d4) Fire damage, and the target’s Speed decreases by 10 feet until the end of the mephit’s next turn. Success: Half damage only. Failure or Success: Being underwater doesn’t grant Resistance to this Fire damage.
Merfolk Skirmisher ~ Amphibious	KEY:Creature ~ Merfolk Skirmisher ~ Amphibious	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Merfolk Skirmisher Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Amphibious	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:The merfolk can breathe air and water.
Merfolk Skirmisher ~ Ocean Spear	KEY:Creature ~ Merfolk Skirmisher ~ Ocean Spear	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Merfolk Skirmisher Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Ocean Spear	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +2, reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft. Hit: 3 (1d6) Piercing damage plus 2 (1d4) Cold damage. If the target is a creature, its Speed decreases by 10 feet until the end of its next turn. Hit or Miss: The spear magically returns to the merfolk’s hand immediately after a ranged attack.
Merrow ~ Amphibious	KEY:Creature ~ Merrow ~ Amphibious	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Merrow Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Amphibious	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:The merrow can breathe air and water.
Merrow ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Merrow ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Merrow Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:The merrow makes two attacks, using Bite, Claw, or Harpoon in any combination.
Merrow ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Merrow ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Merrow Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d4 + 4) Piercing damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the end of the merrow’s next turn.
Merrow ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Merrow ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Merrow Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 9 (2d4 + 4) Slashing damage.
Merrow ~ Harpoon	KEY:Creature ~ Merrow ~ Harpoon	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Merrow Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Harpoon	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Piercing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, the merrow pulls the target up to 15 feet straight toward itself.
Mimic ~ Adhesive (Object Form Only)	KEY:Creature ~ Mimic ~ Adhesive (Object Form Only)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mimic Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Adhesive (Object Form Only)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:The mimic adheres to anything that touches it. A Huge or smaller creature adhered to the mimic has the Grappled condition (escape DC 13). Ability checks made to escape this grapple have Disadvantage.
Mimic ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Mimic ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mimic Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5 (with Advantage if the target is Grappled by the mimic), reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Piercing damage—or 12 (2d8 + 3) Piercing damage if the target is Grappled by the mimic—plus 4 (1d8) Acid damage.
Mimic ~ Pseudopod	KEY:Creature ~ Mimic ~ Pseudopod	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mimic Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pseudopod	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Bludgeoning damage plus 4 (1d8) Acid damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 13). Ability checks made to escape this grapple have Disadvantage.
Mimic ~ Shape-Shift	KEY:Creature ~ Mimic ~ Shape-Shift	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mimic Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Shape-Shift	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.308	DESC:The mimic shape-shifts to resemble a Medium or Small object while retaining its game statistics, or it returns to its true blob form. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed.
Minotaur of Baphomet ~ Abyssal Glaive	KEY:Creature ~ Minotaur of Baphomet ~ Abyssal Glaive	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Minotaur of Baphomet Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Abyssal Glaive	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 10 ft. Hit: 10 (1d12 + 4) Slashing damage plus 10 (3d6) Necrotic damage.
Minotaur of Baphomet ~ Gore (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Minotaur of Baphomet ~ Gore (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Minotaur of Baphomet Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Gore (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 18 (4d6 + 4) Piercing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature and the minotaur moved 10+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target takes an extra 10 (3d6) Piercing damage and has the Prone condition.
Mummy ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:The mummy makes two Rotting Fist attacks and uses Dreadful Glare.
Mummy ~ Rotting Fist	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy ~ Rotting Fist	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rotting Fist	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 8 (1d10 + 3) Bludgeoning damage plus 10 (3d6) Necrotic damage. If the target is a creature, it is cursed. While cursed, the target can’t regain Hit Points, its Hit Point maximum doesn’t return to normal when finishing a Long Rest, and its Hit Point maximum decreases by 10 (3d6) every 24 hours that elapse. A creature dies and turns to dust if reduced to 0 Hit Points by this attack.
Mummy ~ Dreadful Glare	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy ~ Dreadful Glare	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Dreadful Glare	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 11, one creature the mummy can see within 60 feet. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition until the end of the mummy’s next turn. Success: The target is immune to this mummy’s Dreadful Glare for 24 hours.
Mummy Lord ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy Lord ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Lord Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:The mummy has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Mummy Lord ~ Undead Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy Lord ~ Undead Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Lord Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Undead Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:If destroyed, the mummy gains a new body in 24 hours if its heart is intact, reviving with all its Hit Points. The new body appears in an unoccupied space within the mummy’s lair. The heart is a Tiny object that has AC 17, HP 10, and Immunity to all damage except Fire.
Mummy Lord ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy Lord ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Lord Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:The mummy makes one Rotting Fist or Channel Negative Energy attack, and it uses Dreadful Glare.
Mummy Lord ~ Rotting Fist	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy Lord ~ Rotting Fist	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Lord Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rotting Fist	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 5 ft. Hit: 15 (2d10 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 10 (3d6) Necrotic damage. If the target is a creature, it is cursed. While cursed, the target can’t regain Hit Points, it gains no benefit from finishing a Long Rest, and its Hit Point maximum decreases by 10 (3d6) every 24 hours that elapse. A creature dies and turns to dust if reduced to 0 Hit Points by this attack.
Mummy Lord ~ Channel Negative Energy	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy Lord ~ Channel Negative Energy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Lord Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Channel Negative Energy	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +9, range 60 ft. Hit: 25 (6d6 + 4) Necrotic damage.
Mummy Lord ~ Dreadful Glare	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy Lord ~ Dreadful Glare	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Lord Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Dreadful Glare	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 17, one creature the mummy can see within 60 feet. Failure: 25 (6d6 + 4) Psychic damage, and the target has the Paralyzed condition until the end of the mummy’s next turn.
Mummy Lord ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy Lord ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Lord Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:The mummy casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 17, +9 to hit with spell attacks): At Will: Dispel Magic , Thaumaturgy 1/Day Each: Animate Dead , Harm , Insect Plague (level 7 version)
Mummy Lord ~ Whirlwind of Sand	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy Lord ~ Whirlwind of Sand	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Lord Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Whirlwind of Sand	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:Trigger: The mummy is hit by an attack roll. Response: The mummy adds 2 to its AC against the attack, possibly causing the attack to miss, and the mummy teleports up to 60 feet to an unoccupied space it can see. Each creature of its choice that it can see within 5 feet of its destination space has the Blinded condition until the end of the mummy’s next turn.
Mummy Lord ~ Dread Command	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy Lord ~ Dread Command	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Lord Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Dread Command	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:The mummy casts Command (level 2 version), using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting. The mummy can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
Mummy Lord ~ Glare	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy Lord ~ Glare	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Lord Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Glare	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:The mummy uses Dreadful Glare. The mummy can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
Mummy Lord ~ Necrotic Strike	KEY:Creature ~ Mummy Lord ~ Necrotic Strike	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mummy Lord Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Necrotic Strike	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.309	DESC:The mummy makes one Rotting Fist or Channel Negative Energy attack.
Nalfeshnee ~ Demonic Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Nalfeshnee ~ Demonic Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Nalfeshnee Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Demonic Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.310	DESC:If the nalfeshnee dies outside the Abyss, its body dissolves into ichor, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Abyss.
Nalfeshnee ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Nalfeshnee ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Nalfeshnee Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.310	DESC:The nalfeshnee has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Nalfeshnee ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Nalfeshnee ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Nalfeshnee Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.310	DESC:The nalfeshnee makes three Rend attacks.
Nalfeshnee ~ Rend	KEY:Creature ~ Nalfeshnee ~ Rend	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Nalfeshnee Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rend	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.310	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 10 ft. Hit: 16 (2d10 + 5) Slashing damage plus 11 (2d10) Force damage.
Nalfeshnee ~ Teleport	KEY:Creature ~ Nalfeshnee ~ Teleport	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Nalfeshnee Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Teleport	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.310	DESC:The nalfeshnee teleports up to 120 feet to an unoccupied space it can see.
Nalfeshnee ~ Horror Nimbus (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Nalfeshnee ~ Horror Nimbus (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Nalfeshnee Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Horror Nimbus (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.310	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 15, each creature in a 15-foot Emanation originating from the nalfeshnee. Failure: 28 (8d6) Psychic damage, and the target has the Frightened condition for 1 minute, until it takes damage, or until it ends its turn with the nalfeshnee out of line of sight. Success: The target is immune to this nalfeshnee’s Horror Nimbus for 24 hours.
Nalfeshnee ~ Pursuit	KEY:Creature ~ Nalfeshnee ~ Pursuit	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Nalfeshnee Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pursuit	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.310	DESC:Trigger: Another creature the nalfeshnee can see ends its move within 120 feet of the nalfeshnee. Response: The nalfeshnee uses Teleport, but its destination space must be within 10 feet of the triggering creature.
Night Hag ~ Coven Magic	KEY:Creature ~ Night Hag ~ Coven Magic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Night Hag Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Coven Magic	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.311	DESC:While within 30 feet of at least two hag allies, the hag can cast one of the following spells, requiring no Material components, using the spell’s normal casting time, and using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 14): Augury , Find Familiar , Identify , Locate Object , Scrying , or Unseen Servant . The hag must finish a Long Rest before using this trait to cast that spell again.
Night Hag ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Night Hag ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Night Hag Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.311	DESC:The hag has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Night Hag ~ Soul Bag	KEY:Creature ~ Night Hag ~ Soul Bag	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Night Hag Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Soul Bag	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.311	DESC:The hag has a soul bag. While holding or carrying the bag, the hag can use its Nightmare Haunting action. The bag has AC 15, HP 20, and Resistance to all damage. The bag turns to dust if reduced to 0 Hit Points. If the bag is destroyed, any souls the bag is holding are released. The hag can create a new bag after 7 days.
Night Hag ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Night Hag ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Night Hag Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.311	DESC:The hag makes two Claw attacks.
Night Hag ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Night Hag ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Night Hag Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.311	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Slashing damage. Nightmare Haunting (1/Day; Requires Soul Bag). While on the Ethereal Plane, the hag casts Dream , using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting. Only the hag can serve as the spell’s messenger, and the target must be a creature the hag can see on the Material Plane. The spell fails and is wasted if the target is under the effect of the Protection from Evil and Good spell or within a Magic Circle spell. If the target takes damage from the Dream spell, the target’s Hit Point maximum decreases by an amount equal to that damage. If the spell kills the target, its soul is trapped in the hag’s soul bag, and the target can’t be raised from the dead until its soul is released.
Night Hag ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Night Hag ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Night Hag Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.311	DESC:The hag casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 14): At Will: Detect Magic , Etherealness , Magic Missile (level 4 version) 2/Day Each: Phantasmal Killer , Plane Shift (self only)
Night Hag ~ Shape-Shift	KEY:Creature ~ Night Hag ~ Shape-Shift	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Night Hag Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Shape-Shift	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.311	DESC:The hag shape-shifts into a Small or Medium Humanoid, or it returns to its true form. Other than its size, its game statistics are the same in each form. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed.
Nightmare ~ Confer Fire Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Nightmare ~ Confer Fire Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Nightmare Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Confer Fire Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.311	DESC:The nightmare can grant Resistance to Fire damage to a rider while it is on the nightmare.
Nightmare ~ Illumination	KEY:Creature ~ Nightmare ~ Illumination	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Nightmare Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Illumination	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.311	DESC:The nightmare sheds Bright Light in a 10foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 10 feet.
Nightmare ~ Hooves	KEY:Creature ~ Nightmare ~ Hooves	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Nightmare Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Hooves	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.311	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 10 (3d6) Fire damage.
Nightmare ~ Ethereal Stride	KEY:Creature ~ Nightmare ~ Ethereal Stride	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Nightmare Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Ethereal Stride	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.311	DESC:The nightmare and up to three willing creatures within 5 feet of it teleport to the Ethereal Plane from the Material Plane or vice versa.
Noble ~ Rapier	KEY:Creature ~ Noble ~ Rapier	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Noble Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rapier	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +3, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d8 + 1) Piercing damage.
Noble ~ Parry	KEY:Creature ~ Noble ~ Parry	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Noble Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Parry	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:Trigger: The noble is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. Response: The noble adds 2 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss.
Ochre Jelly ~ Amorphous	KEY:Creature ~ Ochre Jelly ~ Amorphous	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ochre Jelly Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Amorphous	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:The jelly can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch without expending extra movement to do so.
Ochre Jelly ~ Spider Climb	KEY:Creature ~ Ochre Jelly ~ Spider Climb	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ochre Jelly Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spider Climb	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:The jelly can climb difficult surfaces, including along ceilings, without needing to make an ability check.
Ochre Jelly ~ Pseudopod	KEY:Creature ~ Ochre Jelly ~ Pseudopod	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ochre Jelly Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pseudopod	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 12 (3d6 + 2) Acid damage.
Ochre Jelly ~ Split	KEY:Creature ~ Ochre Jelly ~ Split	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ochre Jelly Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Split	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:Trigger: While the jelly is Large or Medium and has 10+ Hit Points, it becomes Bloodied or is subjected to Lightning or Slashing damage. Response: The jelly splits into two new Ochre Jellies . Each new jelly is one size smaller than the original jelly and acts on its Initiative. The original jelly’s Hit Points are divided evenly between the new jellies (round down).
Ogre ~ Greatclub	KEY:Creature ~ Ogre ~ Greatclub	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ogre Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Greatclub	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Bludgeoning damage.
Ogre ~ Javelin	KEY:Creature ~ Ogre ~ Javelin	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ogre Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Javelin	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. or range 30/120 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Piercing damage.
Oni ~ Regeneration	KEY:Creature ~ Oni ~ Regeneration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Oni Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Regeneration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:The oni regains 10 Hit Points at the start of each of its turns if it has at least 1 Hit Point.
Oni ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Oni ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Oni Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:The oni makes two Claw or Nightmare Ray attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Spellcasting.
Oni ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Oni ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Oni Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 10 ft. Hit: 10 (1d12 + 4) Slashing damage plus 9 (2d8) Necrotic damage.
Oni ~ Nightmare Ray	KEY:Creature ~ Oni ~ Nightmare Ray	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Oni Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Nightmare Ray	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +5, range 60 ft. Hit: 9 (2d6 + 2) Psychic damage, and the target has the Frightened condition until the start of the oni’s next turn.
Oni ~ Shape-Shift	KEY:Creature ~ Oni ~ Shape-Shift	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Oni Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Shape-Shift	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:The oni shape-shifts into a Small or Medium Humanoid or a Large Giant, or it returns to its true form. Other than its size, its game statistics are the same in each form. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed.
Oni ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Oni ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Oni Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:The oni casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 13): 1/Day Each: Charm Person (level 2 version), Darkness , Gaseous Form , Sleep
Oni ~ Invisibility	KEY:Creature ~ Oni ~ Invisibility	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Oni Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Invisibility	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.312	DESC:The oni casts Invisibility on itself, requiring no spell components and using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.
Otyugh ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Otyugh ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Otyugh Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.313	DESC:The otyugh makes one Bite attack and two Tentacle attacks.
Otyugh ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Otyugh ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Otyugh Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.313	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 12 (2d8 + 3) Piercing damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition. Whenever the Poisoned target finishes a Long Rest, it is subjected to the following effect. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 15. Failure: The target’s Hit Point maximum decreases by 5 (1d10) and doesn’t return to normal until the Poisoned condition ends on the target. Success: The Poisoned condition ends.
Otyugh ~ Tentacle	KEY:Creature ~ Otyugh ~ Tentacle	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Otyugh Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Tentacle	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.313	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 10 ft. Hit: 12 (2d8 + 3) Piercing damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 13) from one of two tentacles.
Otyugh ~ Tentacle Slam	KEY:Creature ~ Otyugh ~ Tentacle Slam	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Otyugh Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Tentacle Slam	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.313	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 14, each creature Grappled by the otyugh. Failure: 16 (3d8 + 3) Bludgeoning damage, and the target has the Stunned condition until the start of the otyugh’s next turn. Success: Half damage only.
Owlbear ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Owlbear ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Owlbear Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.313	DESC:The owlbear makes two Rend attacks.
Owlbear ~ Rend	KEY:Creature ~ Owlbear ~ Rend	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Owlbear Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rend	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.313	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 14 (2d8 + 5) Slashing damage.
Pegasus ~ Hooves	KEY:Creature ~ Pegasus ~ Hooves	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pegasus Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Hooves	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.313	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d6 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 5 (2d4) Radiant damage.
Phase Spider ~ Ethereal Sight	KEY:Creature ~ Phase Spider ~ Ethereal Sight	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Phase Spider Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Ethereal Sight	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.313	DESC:The spider can see 60 feet into the Ethereal Plane while on the Material Plane and vice versa.
Phase Spider ~ Spider Climb	KEY:Creature ~ Phase Spider ~ Spider Climb	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Phase Spider Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spider Climb	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.313	DESC:The spider can climb difficult surfaces, including along ceilings, without needing to make an ability check.
Phase Spider ~ Web Walker	KEY:Creature ~ Phase Spider ~ Web Walker	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Phase Spider Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Web Walker	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.313	DESC:The spider ignores movement restrictions caused by webs, and the spider knows the location of any other creature in contact with the same web.
Phase Spider ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Phase Spider ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Phase Spider Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.313	DESC:The spider makes two Bite attacks.
Phase Spider ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Phase Spider ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Phase Spider Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.313	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 8 (1d10 + 3) Piercing damage plus 9 (2d8) Poison damage. If this damage reduces the target to 0 Hit Points, the target becomes Stable, and it has the Poisoned condition for 1 hour. While Poisoned, the target also has the Paralyzed condition.
Phase Spider ~ Ethereal Jaunt	KEY:Creature ~ Phase Spider ~ Ethereal Jaunt	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Phase Spider Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Ethereal Jaunt	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.313	DESC:The spider teleports from the Material Plane to the Ethereal Plane or vice versa.
Pirate ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Pirate ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pirate Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:The pirate makes two Dagger attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Enthralling Panache.
Pirate ~ Dagger	KEY:Creature ~ Pirate ~ Dagger	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pirate Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Dagger	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft. Hit: 5 (1d4 + 3) Piercing damage.
Pirate ~ Enthralling Panache	KEY:Creature ~ Pirate ~ Enthralling Panache	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pirate Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Enthralling Panache	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 12, one creature the pirate can see within 30 feet. Failure: The target has the Charmed condition until the start of the pirate’s next turn.
Pirate Captain ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Pirate Captain ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pirate Captain Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:The pirate makes three attacks, using Rapier or Pistol in any combination.
Pirate Captain ~ Rapier	KEY:Creature ~ Pirate Captain ~ Rapier	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pirate Captain Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rapier	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Piercing damage, and the pirate has Advantage on the next attack roll it makes before the end of this turn.
Pirate Captain ~ Pistol	KEY:Creature ~ Pirate Captain ~ Pistol	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pirate Captain Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pistol	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +7, range 30/90 ft. Hit: 15 (2d10 + 4) Piercing damage.
Pirate Captain ~ Captain’s Charm	KEY:Creature ~ Pirate Captain ~ Captain’s Charm	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pirate Captain Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Captain’s Charm	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 14, one creature the pirate can see within 30 feet. Failure: The target has the Charmed condition until the start of the pirate’s next turn.
Pirate Captain ~ Riposte	KEY:Creature ~ Pirate Captain ~ Riposte	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pirate Captain Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Riposte	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:Trigger: The pirate is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. Response: The pirate adds 3 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss. On a miss, the pirate makes one Rapier attack against the triggering creature if within range.
Pit Fiend ~ Diabolical Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Pit Fiend ~ Diabolical Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pit Fiend Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Diabolical Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:If the pit fiend dies outside the Nine Hells, its body disappears in sulfurous smoke, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Nine Hells.
Pit Fiend ~ Fear Aura	KEY:Creature ~ Pit Fiend ~ Fear Aura	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pit Fiend Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fear Aura	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:The pit fiend emanates an aura in a 20foot Emanation while it doesn’t have the Incapacitated condition. Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 21, any enemy that starts its turn in the aura. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition until the start of its next turn. Success: The target is immune to this pit fiend’s aura for 24 hours.
Pit Fiend ~ Legendary Resistance (4/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Pit Fiend ~ Legendary Resistance (4/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pit Fiend Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Legendary Resistance (4/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:If the pit fiend fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.
Pit Fiend ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Pit Fiend ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pit Fiend Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:The pit fiend has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Pit Fiend ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Pit Fiend ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pit Fiend Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:The pit fiend makes one Bite attack, two Devilish Claw attacks, and one Fiery Mace attack.
Pit Fiend ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Pit Fiend ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pit Fiend Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +14, reach 10 ft. Hit: 18 (3d6 + 8) Piercing damage. If the target is a creature, it must make the following saving throw. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 21. Failure: The target has the Poisoned condition. While Poisoned, the target can’t regain Hit Points and takes 21 (6d6) Poison damage at the start of each of its turns, and it repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically.
Pit Fiend ~ Devilish Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Pit Fiend ~ Devilish Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pit Fiend Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Devilish Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +14, reach 10 ft. Hit: 26 (4d8 + 8) Necrotic damage.
Pit Fiend ~ Fiery Mace	KEY:Creature ~ Pit Fiend ~ Fiery Mace	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pit Fiend Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fiery Mace	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +14, reach 10 ft. Hit: 22 (4d6 + 8) Force damage plus 21 (6d6) Fire damage.
Pit Fiend ~ Hellfire Spellcasting (Recharge 4–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Pit Fiend ~ Hellfire Spellcasting (Recharge 4–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Pit Fiend Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Hellfire Spellcasting (Recharge 4–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.314	DESC:The pit fiend casts Fireball (level 5 version) twice, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 21). It can replace one Fireball with Hold Monster (level 7 version) or Wall of Fire.
Planetar ~ Divine Awareness	KEY:Creature ~ Planetar ~ Divine Awareness	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Planetar Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Divine Awareness	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.315	DESC:The planetar knows if it hears a lie.
Planetar ~ Exalted Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Planetar ~ Exalted Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Planetar Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Exalted Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.315	DESC:If the planetar dies outside Mount Celestia, its body disappears, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in Mount Celestia.
Planetar ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Planetar ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Planetar Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.315	DESC:The planetar has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Planetar ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Planetar ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Planetar Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.315	DESC:The planetar makes three Radiant Sword attacks or uses Holy Burst twice.
Planetar ~ Radiant Sword	KEY:Creature ~ Planetar ~ Radiant Sword	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Planetar Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Radiant Sword	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.315	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +12, reach 10 ft. Hit: 14 (2d6 + 7) Slashing damage plus 18 (4d8) Radiant damage.
Planetar ~ Holy Burst	KEY:Creature ~ Planetar ~ Holy Burst	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Planetar Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Holy Burst	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.315	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 20, each enemy in a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point the planetar can see within 120 feet. Failure: 24 (7d6) Radiant damage. Success: Half damage.
Planetar ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Planetar ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Planetar Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.315	DESC:The planetar casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as spellcasting ability (spell save DC 20): At Will: Detect Evil and Good 1/Day Each: Commune , Control Weather , Dispel Evil and Good , Raise Dead
Planetar ~ Divine Aid (2/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Planetar ~ Divine Aid (2/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Planetar Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Divine Aid (2/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.315	DESC:The planetar casts Cure Wounds , Invisibility , Lesser Restoration , or Remove Curse , using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.
Priest Acolyte ~ Mace	KEY:Creature ~ Priest Acolyte ~ Mace	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Priest Acolyte Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Mace	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.316	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Bludgeoning damage plus 2 (1d4) Radiant damage.
Priest Acolyte ~ Radiant Flame	KEY:Creature ~ Priest Acolyte ~ Radiant Flame	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Priest Acolyte Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Radiant Flame	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.316	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +4, range 60 ft. Hit: 7 (2d6) Radiant damage.
