Priest Acolyte ~ Divine Aid (1/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Priest Acolyte ~ Divine Aid (1/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Priest Acolyte Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Divine Aid (1/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.316	DESC:The priest casts Bless , Healing Word , or Sanctuary , using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.
Priest ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Priest ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Priest Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.316	DESC:The priest makes two attacks, using Mace or Radiant Flame in any combination.
Priest ~ Mace	KEY:Creature ~ Priest ~ Mace	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Priest Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Mace	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.316	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d6 + 3) Bludgeoning damage plus 5 (2d4) Radiant damage.
Priest ~ Radiant Flame	KEY:Creature ~ Priest ~ Radiant Flame	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Priest Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Radiant Flame	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.316	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +5, range 60 ft. Hit: 11 (2d10) Radiant damage.
Priest ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Priest ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Priest Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.316	DESC:The priest casts one of the following spells, using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 13): At Will: Light , Thaumaturgy 1/Day: Spirit Guardians
Priest ~ Divine Aid (3/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Priest ~ Divine Aid (3/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Priest Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Divine Aid (3/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.316	DESC:The priest casts Bless , Dispel Magic , Healing Word , or Lesser Restoration , using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.
