Ancient Red Dragon ~ Commanding Presence	KEY:Creature ~ Ancient Red Dragon ~ Commanding Presence	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ancient Red Dragon Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Commanding Presence	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.319	DESC:The dragon uses Spellcasting to cast Command (level 2 version). The dragon can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
