Ancient Red Dragon ~ Pounce	KEY:Creature ~ Ancient Red Dragon ~ Pounce	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Ancient Red Dragon Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pounce	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.319	DESC:The dragon moves up to half its Speed, and it makes one Rend attack.
