Remorhaz ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Remorhaz ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Remorhaz Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.319	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +11, reach 10 ft. Hit: 18 (2d10 + 7) Piercing damage plus 14 (4d6) Fire damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 17), and it has the Restrained condition until the grapple ends.
Remorhaz ~ Swallow	KEY:Creature ~ Remorhaz ~ Swallow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Remorhaz Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Swallow	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.319	DESC:Strength Saving Throw: DC 19, one Large or smaller creature Grappled by the remorhaz (it can have up to two creatures swallowed at a time). Failure: The target is swallowed by the remorhaz, and the Grappled condition ends. A swallowed creature has the Blinded and Restrained conditions, it has Total Cover against attacks and other effects outside the remorhaz, and it takes 10 (3d6) Acid damage plus 10 (3d6) Fire damage at the start of each of the remorhaz’s turns. If the remorhaz takes 30 damage or more on a single turn from a creature inside it, the remorhaz must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw at the end of that turn or regurgitate all swallowed creatures, each of which falls in a space within 5 feet of the remorhaz and has the Prone condition. If the remorhaz dies, any swallowed creature no longer has the Restrained condition and can escape from the corpse by using 15 feet of movement, exiting Prone.
Roc ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Roc ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Roc Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:The roc makes two Beak attacks. It can replace one attack with a Talons attack.
Roc ~ Beak	KEY:Creature ~ Roc ~ Beak	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Roc Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Beak	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +13, reach 10 ft. Hit: 28 (3d12 + 9) Piercing damage.
Roc ~ Talons	KEY:Creature ~ Roc ~ Talons	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Roc Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Talons	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +13, reach 5 ft. Hit: 23 (4d6 + 9) Slashing damage. If the target is a Huge or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 19) from both talons, and it has the Restrained condition until the grapple ends.
Roc ~ Swoop (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Roc ~ Swoop (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Roc Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Swoop (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:If the roc has a creature Grappled, the roc flies up to half its Fly Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks and drops that creature.
Roper ~ Spider Climb	KEY:Creature ~ Roper ~ Spider Climb	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Roper Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spider Climb	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:The roper can climb difficult surfaces, including along ceilings, without needing to make an ability check.
Roper ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Roper ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Roper Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:The roper makes two Tentacle attacks, uses Reel, and makes two Bite attacks.
Roper ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Roper ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Roper Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 17 (3d8 + 4) Piercing damage.
Roper ~ Tentacle	KEY:Creature ~ Roper ~ Tentacle	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Roper Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Tentacle	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 60 ft. Hit: The target has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14) from one of six tentacles, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the grapple ends. The tentacle can be damaged, freeing a creature it has Grappled when destroyed (AC 20, HP 10, Immunity to Poison and Psychic damage). Damaging the tentacle deals no damage to the roper, and a destroyed tentacle regrows at the start of the roper’s next turn.
Roper ~ Reel	KEY:Creature ~ Roper ~ Reel	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Roper Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Reel	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:The roper pulls each creature Grappled by it up to 30 feet straight toward it.
Rust Monster ~ Iron Scent	KEY:Creature ~ Rust Monster ~ Iron Scent	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Rust Monster Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Iron Scent	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:The rust monster can pinpoint the location of ferrous metal within 30 feet of itself.
Rust Monster ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Rust Monster ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Rust Monster Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:The rust monster makes one Bite attack and uses Antennae twice.
Rust Monster ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Rust Monster ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Rust Monster Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +3, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d8 + 1) Piercing damage.
Rust Monster ~ Antennae	KEY:Creature ~ Rust Monster ~ Antennae	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Rust Monster Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Antennae	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:The rust monster targets one nonmagical metal object—armor or a weapon—worn or carried by a creature within 5 feet of itself. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 11, the creature with the object. Failure: The object takes a −1 penalty to the AC it offers (armor) or to its attack rolls (weapon). Armor is destroyed if the penalty reduces its AC to 10, and a weapon is destroyed if its penalty reaches −5. The penalty can be removed by casting the Mending spell on the armor or weapon.
Rust Monster ~ Destroy Metal	KEY:Creature ~ Rust Monster ~ Destroy Metal	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Rust Monster Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Destroy Metal	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:The rust monster touches a nonmagical metal object within 5 feet of itself that isn’t being worn or carried. The touch destroys a 1-foot Cube of the object.
Rust Monster ~ Reflexive Antennae	KEY:Creature ~ Rust Monster ~ Reflexive Antennae	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Rust Monster Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Reflexive Antennae	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.320	DESC:Trigger: An attack roll hits the rust monster. Response: The rust monster uses Antennae.
Sahuagin Warrior ~ Blood Frenzy	KEY:Creature ~ Sahuagin Warrior ~ Blood Frenzy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sahuagin Warrior Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Blood Frenzy	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.321	DESC:The sahuagin has Advantage on attack rolls against any creature that doesn’t have all its Hit Points.
Sahuagin Warrior ~ Limited Amphibiousness	KEY:Creature ~ Sahuagin Warrior ~ Limited Amphibiousness	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sahuagin Warrior Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Limited Amphibiousness	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.321	DESC:The sahuagin can breathe air and water, but it must be submerged at least once every 4 hours to avoid suffocating outside water.
Sahuagin Warrior ~ Shark Telepathy	KEY:Creature ~ Sahuagin Warrior ~ Shark Telepathy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sahuagin Warrior Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Shark Telepathy	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.321	DESC:The sahuagin can magically control sharks within 120 feet of itself, using a special telepathy.
Sahuagin Warrior ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Sahuagin Warrior ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sahuagin Warrior Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.321	DESC:The sahuagin makes two Claw attacks.
Sahuagin Warrior ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Sahuagin Warrior ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sahuagin Warrior Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.321	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +3, reach 5 ft. Hit: 4 (1d6 + 1) Slashing damage.
Sahuagin Warrior ~ Aquatic Charge	KEY:Creature ~ Sahuagin Warrior ~ Aquatic Charge	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sahuagin Warrior Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Aquatic Charge	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.321	DESC:The sahuagin swims up to its Swim Speed straight toward an enemy it can see.
Salamander ~ Fire Aura	KEY:Creature ~ Salamander ~ Fire Aura	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Salamander Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fire Aura	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.321	DESC:At the end of each of the salamander’s turns, each creature of the salamander’s choice in a 5-foot Emanation originating from the salamander takes 7 (2d6) Fire damage.
Salamander ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Salamander ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Salamander Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.321	DESC:The salamander makes two Flame Spear attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Constrict.
Salamander ~ Flame Spear	KEY:Creature ~ Salamander ~ Flame Spear	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Salamander Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Flame Spear	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.321	DESC:Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Piercing damage plus 7 (2d6) Fire damage. Hit or Miss: The spear magically returns to the salamander’s hand immediately after a ranged attack.
Salamander ~ Constrict	KEY:Creature ~ Salamander ~ Constrict	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Salamander Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Constrict	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.321	DESC:Strength Saving Throw: DC 15, one Large or smaller creature the salamander can see within 10 feet. Failure: 11 (2d6 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 7 (2d6) Fire damage. The target has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14), and it has the Restrained condition until the grapple ends.
Satyr ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Satyr ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Satyr Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.321	DESC:The satyr has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Satyr ~ Hooves	KEY:Creature ~ Satyr ~ Hooves	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Satyr Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Hooves	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.321	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d4 + 3) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, the satyr pushes the target up to 10 feet straight away from itself.
Satyr ~ Mockery	KEY:Creature ~ Satyr ~ Mockery	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Satyr Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Mockery	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.321	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 12, one creature the satyr can see within 90 feet. Failure: 5 (1d6 + 2) Psychic damage.
Scout ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Scout ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Scout Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.322	DESC:The scout makes two attacks, using Shortsword and Longbow in any combination.
Scout ~ Shortsword	KEY:Creature ~ Scout ~ Shortsword	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Scout Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Shortsword	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.322	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Piercing damage.
Scout ~ Longbow	KEY:Creature ~ Scout ~ Longbow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Scout Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Longbow	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.322	DESC:Ranged Attack Roll: +4, range 150/600 ft. Hit: 6 (1d8 + 2) Piercing damage.
Sea Hag ~ Amphibious	KEY:Creature ~ Sea Hag ~ Amphibious	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sea Hag Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Amphibious	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.322	DESC:The hag can breathe air and water.
Sea Hag ~ Coven Magic	KEY:Creature ~ Sea Hag ~ Coven Magic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sea Hag Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Coven Magic	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.322	DESC:While within 30 feet of at least two hag allies, the hag can cast one of the following spells, requiring no Material components, using the spell’s normal casting time, and using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 11): Augury , Find Familiar , Identify , Locate Object , Scrying , or Unseen Servant . The hag must finish a Long Rest before using this trait to cast that spell again.
Sea Hag ~ Vile Appearance	KEY:Creature ~ Sea Hag ~ Vile Appearance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sea Hag Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Vile Appearance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.322	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 11, any Beast or Humanoid that starts its turn within 30 feet of the hag and can see the hag’s true form. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition until the start of its next turn. Success: The target is immune to this hag’s Vile Appearance for 24 hours.
Sea Hag ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Sea Hag ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sea Hag Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.322	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (2d6 + 3) Slashing damage.
Sea Hag ~ Death Glare (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Sea Hag ~ Death Glare (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sea Hag Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Death Glare (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.322	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 11, one Frightened creature the hag can see within 30 feet. Failure: If the target has 20 Hit Points or fewer, it drops to 0 Hit Points. Otherwise, the target takes 13 (3d8) Psychic damage.
Sea Hag ~ Illusory Appearance	KEY:Creature ~ Sea Hag ~ Illusory Appearance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sea Hag Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Illusory Appearance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.322	DESC:The hag casts Disguise Self , using Constitution as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 13). The spell’s duration is 24 hours.
Shadow ~ Amorphous	KEY:Creature ~ Shadow ~ Amorphous	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shadow Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Amorphous	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.322	DESC:The shadow can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch without expending extra movement to do so.
Shadow ~ Sunlight Weakness	KEY:Creature ~ Shadow ~ Sunlight Weakness	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shadow Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Sunlight Weakness	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.322	DESC:While in sunlight, the shadow has Disadvantage on D20 Tests.
Shadow ~ Draining Swipe	KEY:Creature ~ Shadow ~ Draining Swipe	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shadow Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Draining Swipe	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.322	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Necrotic damage, and the target’s Strength score decreases by 1d4. The target dies if this reduces that score to 0. If a Humanoid is slain by this attack, a Shadow rises from the corpse 1d4 hours later.
Shadow ~ Shadow Stealth	KEY:Creature ~ Shadow ~ Shadow Stealth	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shadow Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Shadow Stealth	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.322	DESC:While in Dim Light or Darkness, the shadow takes the Hide action.
Shambling Mound ~ Lightning Absorption	KEY:Creature ~ Shambling Mound ~ Lightning Absorption	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shambling Mound Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Lightning Absorption	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.323	DESC:Whenever the shambling mound is subjected to Lightning damage, it regains a number of Hit Points equal to the Lightning damage dealt.
Shambling Mound ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Shambling Mound ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shambling Mound Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.323	DESC:The shambling mound makes three Charged Tendril attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Engulf.
Shambling Mound ~ Charged Tendril	KEY:Creature ~ Shambling Mound ~ Charged Tendril	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shambling Mound Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Charged Tendril	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.323	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 10 ft. Hit: 7 (1d6 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 5 (2d4) Lightning damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, the shambling mound pulls the target 5 feet straight toward itself.
Shambling Mound ~ Engulf	KEY:Creature ~ Shambling Mound ~ Engulf	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shambling Mound Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Engulf	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.323	DESC:Strength Saving Throw: DC 15, one Medium or smaller creature within 5 feet. Failure: The target is pulled into the shambling mound’s space and has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14). Until the grapple ends, the target has the Blinded and Restrained conditions, and it takes 10 (3d6) Lightning damage at the start of each of its turns. When the shambling mound moves, the Grappled target moves with it, costing it no extra movement. The shambling mound can have only one creature Grappled by this action at a time.
Shield Guardian ~ Bound	KEY:Creature ~ Shield Guardian ~ Bound	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shield Guardian Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bound	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.323	DESC:The guardian is magically bound to an amulet. While the guardian and its amulet are on the same plane of existence, the amulet’s wearer can telepathically call the guardian to travel to it, and the guardian knows the distance and direction to the amulet. If the guardian is within 60 feet of the amulet’s wearer, half of any damage the wearer takes (round up) is transferred to the guardian.
Shield Guardian ~ Regeneration	KEY:Creature ~ Shield Guardian ~ Regeneration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shield Guardian Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Regeneration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.323	DESC:The guardian regains 10 Hit Points at the start of each of its turns if it has at least 1 Hit Point.
Shield Guardian ~ Spell Storing	KEY:Creature ~ Shield Guardian ~ Spell Storing	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shield Guardian Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spell Storing	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.323	DESC:A spellcaster who wears the guardian’s amulet can cause the guardian to store one spell of level 4 or lower. To do so, the wearer must cast the spell on the guardian while within 5 feet of it. The spell has no effect but is stored within the guardian. Any previously stored spell is lost when a new spell is stored. The guardian can cast the spell stored with any parameters set by the original caster, requiring no spell components and using the caster’s spellcasting ability. The stored spell is then lost.
Shield Guardian ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Shield Guardian ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shield Guardian Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.323	DESC:The guardian makes two Fist attacks.
Shield Guardian ~ Fist	KEY:Creature ~ Shield Guardian ~ Fist	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shield Guardian Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fist	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.323	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 10 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 7 (2d6) Force damage.
Shield Guardian ~ Protection	KEY:Creature ~ Shield Guardian ~ Protection	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Shield Guardian Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Protection	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.323	DESC:Trigger: An attack roll hits the wearer of the guardian’s amulet while the wearer is within 5 feet of the guardian. Response: The wearer gains a +5 bonus to AC, including against the triggering attack and possibly causing it to miss, until the start of the guardian’s next turn.
Silver Dragon Wyrmling ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Silver Dragon Wyrmling ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Silver Dragon Wyrmling Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:The dragon makes two Rend attacks.
Silver Dragon Wyrmling ~ Rend	KEY:Creature ~ Silver Dragon Wyrmling ~ Rend	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Silver Dragon Wyrmling Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rend	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 9 (1d10 + 4) Piercing damage.
Silver Dragon Wyrmling ~ Cold Breath (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Silver Dragon Wyrmling ~ Cold Breath (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Silver Dragon Wyrmling Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Cold Breath (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 13, each creature in a 15-foot Cone. Failure: 18 (4d8) Cold damage. Success: Half damage.
Silver Dragon Wyrmling ~ Paralyzing Breath	KEY:Creature ~ Silver Dragon Wyrmling ~ Paralyzing Breath	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Silver Dragon Wyrmling Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Paralyzing Breath	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 13, each creature in a 15-foot Cone. First Failure: The target has the Incapacitated condition until the end of its next turn, when it repeats the save. Second Failure: The target has the Paralyzed condition, and it repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically.
Young Silver Dragon ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Young Silver Dragon ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Young Silver Dragon Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:The dragon makes three Rend attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Paralyzing Breath.
Young Silver Dragon ~ Rend	KEY:Creature ~ Young Silver Dragon ~ Rend	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Young Silver Dragon Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rend	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 10 ft. Hit: 15 (2d8 + 6) Slashing damage.
Young Silver Dragon ~ Cold Breath (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Young Silver Dragon ~ Cold Breath (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Young Silver Dragon Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Cold Breath (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 17, each creature in a 30-foot Cone. Failure: 49 (11d8) Cold damage. Success: Half damage.
Young Silver Dragon ~ Paralyzing Breath	KEY:Creature ~ Young Silver Dragon ~ Paralyzing Breath	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Young Silver Dragon Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Paralyzing Breath	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 17, each creature in a 30-foot Cone. First Failure: The target has the Incapacitated condition until the end of its next turn, when it repeats the save. Second Failure: The target has the Paralyzed condition, and it repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically.
Adult Silver Dragon ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Adult Silver Dragon ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Adult Silver Dragon Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:The dragon makes three Rend attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of (A) Paralyzing Breath or (B) Spellcasting to cast Ice Knife .
Adult Silver Dragon ~ Rend	KEY:Creature ~ Adult Silver Dragon ~ Rend	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Adult Silver Dragon Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rend	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +13, reach 10 ft. Hit: 17 (2d8 + 8) Slashing damage plus 4 (1d8) Cold damage.
Adult Silver Dragon ~ Cold Breath (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Adult Silver Dragon ~ Cold Breath (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Adult Silver Dragon Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Cold Breath (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 20, each creature in a 60-foot Cone. Failure: 54 (12d8) Cold damage. Success: Half damage.
Adult Silver Dragon ~ Paralyzing Breath	KEY:Creature ~ Adult Silver Dragon ~ Paralyzing Breath	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Adult Silver Dragon Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Paralyzing Breath	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 20, each creature in a 60-foot Cone. First Failure: The target has the Incapacitated condition until the end of its next turn, when it repeats the save. Second Failure: The target has the Paralyzed condition, and it repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically.
Adult Silver Dragon ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Adult Silver Dragon ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Adult Silver Dragon Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:The dragon casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 19, +11 to hit with spell attacks): At Will: Detect Magic , Hold Monster , Ice Knife , Shapechange (Beast or Humanoid form only, no Temporary Hit Points gained from the spell, and no Concentration or Temporary Hit Points required to maintain the spell) 1/Day Each: Ice Storm (level 5 version), Zone of Truth
Adult Silver Dragon ~ Chill	KEY:Creature ~ Adult Silver Dragon ~ Chill	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Adult Silver Dragon Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Chill	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:The dragon uses Spellcasting to cast Hold Monster . The dragon can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
Adult Silver Dragon ~ Cold Gale	KEY:Creature ~ Adult Silver Dragon ~ Cold Gale	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Adult Silver Dragon Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Cold Gale	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 19, each creature in a 60-foot-long, 10-foot-wide Line. Failure: 14 (4d6) Cold damage, and the target is pushed up to 30 feet straight away from the dragon. Success: Half damage only. Failure or Success: The dragon can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
Adult Silver Dragon ~ Pounce	KEY:Creature ~ Adult Silver Dragon ~ Pounce	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Adult Silver Dragon Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pounce	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.324	DESC:The dragon moves up to half its Speed, and it makes one Rend attack.
