Warhorse Skeleton ~ Hooves	KEY:Creature ~ Warhorse Skeleton ~ Hooves	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Warhorse Skeleton Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Hooves	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d6 + 4) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature and the skeleton moved 20+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target has the Prone condition.
Minotaur Skeleton ~ Gore	KEY:Creature ~ Minotaur Skeleton ~ Gore	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Minotaur Skeleton Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Gore	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Piercing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature and the skeleton moved 20+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target takes an extra 9 (2d8) Piercing damage and has the Prone condition.
Minotaur Skeleton ~ Slam	KEY:Creature ~ Minotaur Skeleton ~ Slam	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Minotaur Skeleton Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Slam	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 15 (2d10 + 4) Bludgeoning damage.
Solar ~ Divine Awareness	KEY:Creature ~ Solar ~ Divine Awareness	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Solar Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Divine Awareness	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:The solar knows if it hears a lie.
Solar ~ Exalted Restoration	KEY:Creature ~ Solar ~ Exalted Restoration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Solar Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Exalted Restoration	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:If the solar dies outside Mount Celestia, its body disappears, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in Mount Celestia.
Solar ~ Legendary Resistance (4/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Solar ~ Legendary Resistance (4/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Solar Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Legendary Resistance (4/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:If the solar fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.
Solar ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Solar ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Solar Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:The solar has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Solar ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Solar ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Solar Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:The solar makes two Flying Sword attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Slaying Bow.
Solar ~ Flying Sword	KEY:Creature ~ Solar ~ Flying Sword	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Solar Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Flying Sword	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +15, reach 10 ft. or range 120 ft. Hit: 22 (4d6 + 8) Slashing damage plus 36 (8d8) Radiant damage. Hit or Miss: The sword magically returns to the solar’s hand or hovers within 5 feet of the solar immediately after a ranged attack.
Solar ~ Slaying Bow	KEY:Creature ~ Solar ~ Slaying Bow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Solar Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Slaying Bow	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 21, one creature the solar can see within 600 feet. Failure: If the creature has 100 Hit Points or fewer, it dies. It otherwise takes 24 (4d8 + 6) Piercing damage plus 36 (8d8) Radiant damage.
Solar ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Solar ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Solar Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:The solar casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 25): At Will: Detect Evil and Good 1/Day Each: Commune , Control Weather , Dispel Evil and Good , Resurrection
Solar ~ Divine Aid (3/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Solar ~ Divine Aid (3/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Solar Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Divine Aid (3/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:The solar casts Cure Wounds (level 2 version), Lesser Restoration , or Remove Curse , using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.
Solar ~ Blinding Gaze	KEY:Creature ~ Solar ~ Blinding Gaze	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Solar Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Blinding Gaze	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 25, one creature the solar can see within 120 feet. Failure: The target has the Blinded condition for 1 minute. Failure or Success: The solar can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
Solar ~ Radiant Teleport	KEY:Creature ~ Solar ~ Radiant Teleport	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Solar Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Radiant Teleport	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.326	DESC:The solar teleports up to 60 feet to an unoccupied space it can see. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 25, each creature in a 10-foot Emanation originating from the solar at its destination space. Failure: 11 (2d10) Radiant damage. Success: Half damage.
Specter ~ Incorporeal Movement	KEY:Creature ~ Specter ~ Incorporeal Movement	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Specter Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Incorporeal Movement	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.327	DESC:The specter can move through other creatures and objects as if they were Difficult Terrain. It takes 5 (1d10) Force damage if it ends its turn inside an object.
Specter ~ Sunlight Sensitivity	KEY:Creature ~ Specter ~ Sunlight Sensitivity	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Specter Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Sunlight Sensitivity	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.327	DESC:While in sunlight, the specter has Disadvantage on ability checks and attack rolls.
Specter ~ Life Drain	KEY:Creature ~ Specter ~ Life Drain	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Specter Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Life Drain	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.327	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (2d6) Necrotic damage. If the target is a creature, its Hit Point maximum decreases by an amount equal to the damage taken.
Sphinx of Wonder ~ Magic Resistance	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Wonder ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Wonder Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Magic Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.327	DESC:The sphinx has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.
Sphinx of Wonder ~ Rend	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Wonder ~ Rend	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Wonder Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Rend	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.327	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d4 + 3) Slashing damage plus 7 (2d6) Radiant damage.
Sphinx of Wonder ~ Burst of Ingenuity (2/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Wonder ~ Burst of Ingenuity (2/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Wonder Trait.MonsterReaction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Burst of Ingenuity (2/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.327	DESC:Trigger: The sphinx or another creature within 30 feet makes an ability check or a saving throw. Response: The sphinx adds 2 to the roll.
Sphinx of Lore ~ Inscrutable	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Lore ~ Inscrutable	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Lore Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Inscrutable	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.327	DESC:No magic can observe the sphinx remotely or detect its thoughts without its permission. Wisdom (Insight) checks made to ascertain its intentions or sincerity are made with Disadvantage. Legendary Resistance (3/Day, or 4/Day in Lair). If the sphinx fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.
Sphinx of Lore ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Lore ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Lore Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.327	DESC:The sphinx makes three Claw attacks.
Sphinx of Lore ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Lore ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Lore Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.327	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +8, reach 5 ft. Hit: 14 (3d6 + 4) Slashing damage.
Sphinx of Lore ~ Mind-Rending Roar (Recharge 5–6)	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Lore ~ Mind-Rending Roar (Recharge 5–6)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Lore Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Mind-Rending Roar (Recharge 5–6)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.327	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 16, each enemy in a 300-foot Emanation originating from the sphinx. Failure: 35 (10d6) Psychic damage, and the target has the Incapacitated condition until the start of the sphinx’s next turn.
Sphinx of Lore ~ Spellcasting	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Lore ~ Spellcasting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Lore Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Spellcasting	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.327	DESC:The sphinx casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 16): At Will: Detect Magic , Identify , Mage Hand , Minor Illusion , Prestidigitation 1/Day Each: Dispel Magic , Legend Lore , Locate Object , Plane Shift , Remove Curse , Tongues
Sphinx of Lore ~ Arcane Prowl	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Lore ~ Arcane Prowl	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Lore Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Arcane Prowl	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.327	DESC:The sphinx can teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space it can see, and it makes one Claw attack.
Sphinx of Lore ~ Weight of Years	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Lore ~ Weight of Years	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Lore Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Weight of Years	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.327	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 16, one creature the sphinx can see within 120 feet. Failure: The target gains 1 Exhaustion level. While the target has any Exhaustion levels, it appears 3d10 years older. Failure or Success: The sphinx can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
