Sphinx of Valor ~ Multiattack	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Valor ~ Multiattack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Valor Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Multiattack	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.328	DESC:The sphinx makes two Claw attacks and uses Roar.
Sphinx of Valor ~ Claw	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Valor ~ Claw	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Valor Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Claw	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.328	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +12, reach 5 ft. Hit: 20 (4d6 + 6) Slashing damage.
Sphinx of Valor ~ Roar (3/Day)	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Valor ~ Roar (3/Day)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Valor Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Roar (3/Day)	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.328	DESC:The sphinx emits a magical roar. Whenever it roars, the roar has a different effect, as detailed below (the sequence resets when it takes a Long Rest): First Roar. Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 20, each enemy in a 500-foot Emanation originating from the sphinx. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition for 1 minute.
Sphinx of Valor ~ Second Roar	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Valor ~ Second Roar	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Valor Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Second Roar	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.328	DESC:Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 20, each enemy in a 500-foot Emanation originating from the sphinx. Failure: The target has the Paralyzed condition, and it repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically.
Sphinx of Valor ~ Third Roar	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Valor ~ Third Roar	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Valor Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Third Roar	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.328	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 20, each enemy in a 500-foot Emanation originating from the sphinx. Failure: 44 (8d10) Thunder damage, and the target has the Prone condition. Success: Half damage only.
