Sphinx of Valor ~ Weight of Years	KEY:Creature ~ Sphinx of Valor ~ Weight of Years	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sphinx of Valor Trait.MonsterLegendaryAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Weight of Years	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.328	DESC:Constitution Saving Throw: DC 16, one creature the sphinx can see within 120 feet. Failure: The target gains 1 Exhaustion level. While the target has any Exhaustion levels, it appears 3d10 years older. Failure or Success: The sphinx can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.
