Sprite ~ Needle Sword	KEY:Creature ~ Sprite ~ Needle Sword	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sprite Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Needle Sword	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.329	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d4 + 4) Piercing damage.
