Wight ~ Necrotic Sword	KEY:Creature ~ Wight ~ Necrotic Sword	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Wight Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Necrotic Sword	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.341	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d8 + 2) Slashing damage plus 4 (1d8) Necrotic damage.
