Will-o’-Wisp ~ Vanish	KEY:Creature ~ Will-o’-Wisp ~ Vanish	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Will-o’-Wisp Trait.MonsterBonusAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Vanish	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.341	DESC:The wisp and its light have the Invisible condition until the wisp’s Concentration ends on this effect, which ends early immediately after the wisp makes an attack roll or uses Consume Life.
