Giant Frog ~ Swallow	KEY:Creature ~ Giant Frog ~ Swallow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Giant Frog Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Swallow	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.351	DESC:The frog swallows a Small or smaller target it is grappling. While swallowed, the target isn’t Grappled but has the Blinded and Restrained conditions, and it has Total Cover against attacks and other effects outside the frog. While swallowing the target, the frog can’t use Bite, and if the frog dies, the swallowed target is no longer Restrained and can escape from the corpse using 5 feet of movement, exiting with the Prone condition. At the end of the frog’s next turn, the swallowed target takes 5 (2d4) Acid damage. If that damage doesn’t kill it, the frog disgorges it, causing it to exit Prone.
