Giant Spider ~ Web Walker	KEY:Creature ~ Giant Spider ~ Web Walker	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Giant Spider Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Web Walker	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.353	DESC:The spider ignores movement restrictions caused by webs, and it knows the location of any other creature in contact with the same web.
