Giant Toad ~ Amphibious	KEY:Creature ~ Giant Toad ~ Amphibious	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Giant Toad Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Amphibious	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.354	DESC:The toad can breathe air and water.
