Giant Toad ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Giant Toad ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Giant Toad Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.354	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Piercing damage plus 5 (2d4) Poison damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 12).
Giant Toad ~ Swallow	KEY:Creature ~ Giant Toad ~ Swallow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Giant Toad Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Swallow	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.354	DESC:The toad swallows a Medium or smaller target it is grappling. While swallowed, the target isn’t Grappled but has the Blinded and Restrained conditions, and it has Total Cover against attacks and other effects outside the toad. In addition, the target takes 10 (3d6) Acid damage at the end of each of the toad’s turns. The toad can have only one target swallowed at a time, and it can’t use Bite while it has a swallowed target. If the toad dies, a swallowed creature is no longer Restrained and can escape from the corpse using 5 feet of movement, exiting with the Prone condition.
Giant Venomous Snake ~ Bite	KEY:Creature ~ Giant Venomous Snake ~ Bite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Giant Venomous Snake Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Bite	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.354	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 10 ft. Hit: 6 (1d4 + 4) Piercing damage plus 4 (1d8) Poison damage.
Giant Vulture ~ Pack Tactics	KEY:Creature ~ Giant Vulture ~ Pack Tactics	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Giant Vulture Trait.MonsterTrait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Pack Tactics	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.354	DESC:The vulture has Advantage on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the vulture’s allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally doesn’t have the Incapacitated condition.
