Triceratops ~ Gore	KEY:Creature ~ Triceratops ~ Gore	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Triceratops Trait.MonsterAction.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Gore	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.363	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 5 ft. Hit: 19 (2d12 + 6) Piercing damage. If the target is Huge or smaller and the triceratops moved 20+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target takes an extra 9 (2d8) Piercing damage and has the Prone condition.
